<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="2.0">
  <book code="MRK" style="id">MALK Lughulu Bible Version</book>
  <para style="h">Maliki</para>
  <para style="toc1">Imbuli Inoghile iyandikighwe na Maliki</para>
  <para style="toc2">Maliki</para>
  <para style="toc3">Malk</para>
  <para style="mt2">Imbuli Inoghile iyandikighwe ne</para>
  <para style="mt1">Maliki</para>
  <para style="imt">Ichilongole</para>
  <para style="ip">Imbuli inoghile iyandikighwe na Maliki ya chitabu chimwe mna pfitabu pfine ipfili mna Laghano lya Sambi ipfilonga mbuli tsa Yesu Kiristu. Chila chitabu chokemighwa Injili (mana yake Imbuli Inoghile). Tsapfandikighwa na tsina Matei, Maliki, Luka na Yohane. Chitabu chino cha Maliki chidodo kubita pfitabu pfiyaghe pfidatu. Pfipfila iwanu wolonga chitabu chino chilongola kwandikighwa kubita pfiyaghe, chandikighwa mne miyaka ya sitini na tano mbaka sabini kulawa Yesu hayakalile muisi. Na iwasomi wengi wotoghola ghendo ka tsachandikighwa mna isi ya Roma kuwaghuma ghumoyo wakiristu iwakalile Roma.</para>
  <para style="ip">Maliki pfipfila iyamanyike ka Yohane Maliki, tsayang'ali yakwangagha na tsina Pauli na Balinaba, lekeni tsakalema kughendelela nawo mna ghumwanza ghwa kuwapetela iwanu Imbuli inoghile (Gham 13:13). Hambele tsakatoghola kwanga keli na Balinaba (Gham 15:37-39). Maliki tsakamanyika ka sale wake mkulu na Petiri (1:5-13). Hata ka Maliki ng'amwonile bae Yesu kwa nenge tsake mwenyegho, iwanu wasomile wotoghola ghendo ka Maliki kandika pfinu pfayalongelighwe na Petiri na apfo pfiwa mwanduso wa aghala ghandike. Mna chitabu chino Maliki kokomangitsa ukuwatenda iwanu wawe iwanang'ina wa Yesu na malangulitso gha Yesu ahala aghomala ghamatsuwa.</para>
  <para style="iot">Ighali mno</para>
  <para style="io">Mne isula ya 1:1-13, Maliki kolonga chitabu chake chilitsa.</para>
  <para style="io">Mne isula ya 1:14-8:21, Maliki kolonga sang'ano tsa Yesu hayang'ali ka Galilaya.</para>
  <para style="io">Mne isula ya 8:22-10:52, Kuya kolonga ghumwanza ghwa Yesu wa kughenda Yelusalemu.</para>
  <para style="io">Mne isula ya 11:1-16:8, Maliki komalitsa kwa kulonga. ghamatsuwa gha Yesu ako Yelusalemu, pfayafile na pfayatsilihuke.</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Yohane Mbatitsa kowapetela iwanu</para>
  <para style="r">(Matei 3:1-12; Luka 3:1-18; Yohane 1:19-28)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Haino Imbuli Inoghile ya Yesu Kiristu, Imwana we Imulungu.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v"/>Yakwandusa ka pfayandikighwe mne chitabu cha nabii Isaya.</para>
  <para style="q">“Imulungu kalonga, ‘Nitsomtuma imtumighwa wangu yakulongole,</para>
  <para style="q">ayo katsoyandaa inzila yako.’</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v"/>Litsi lye imunu lyokema kunyika,</para>
  <para style="q">‘Muyandae inzila ye Imtwatsa,</para>
  <para style="q">muigholose inzila yake.’ ”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v"/>Yohane tsakalawila kunyika, kowapetela iwanu na kowabatitsa. Kawalongela iwanu, “Mtsileke nzambi tsenu namwe mbatitsighwe, na Imulungu katsowaleghusila nzambi tsenu.” <verse number="5" style="v"/>Iwanu wengi walawa mne isi ya Yudeya na mne ghumji ghwa Yerusalemu waghenda kumuhulikitsa Yohane. Watsitoghola nzambi tsawo, naye kawabatitsa mne ghumto Yoridani.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v"/>Yohane tsakapfala lighwanda ilitendighwe kwa ngotsi ya ingamiya, na ghumsipi ghwe ngotsi mchuno, na chijo chake chayang'ali yakuja tsachikala iwanzighe na uki. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Kawalongela iwanu, “Kuchughu kwangu kakutsa yane ingupfu kubita nene. Nene sibamighwa bae hata kwinama na kudohola mitsabi ye imikwabatsa yake. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Nene nowabatitsa mwemwe kwa ghamatsi, lekeni ayo katsowabatitseni kwa Ghumuhe ghwe Imulungu.”</para>
  <para style="s">Kubatitsighwa na kughetsighwa kwa Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(Matei 3:13-4:11; Luka 3:21-22; 4:1-13)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v"/>Ghamatsuwa agho, Yesu tsakatsa kulawa ghumji ghwa Natsareti, mne isi ya Galilaya, kabatitsighwa na Yohane mne ghumto Yoridani. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Yesu hayang'ali yolawa mne ghamatsi, tsakona ililanga lopfughuka na Ghumuhe Mwenzeluka komhulumkila ka injiwa. <verse number="11" style="v"/>Kuya Iitsi lilawa kulanga, “Ghweghwe kwa imwanangu yanikunoghele, ninoghelighwa naghwe.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v"/>Bahala Ghumuhe Mwenzeluka kamlongotsa yaghende kunyika, <verse number="13" style="v"/>kuya kakala ako ghamatsuwa arubaini koghetsighwa na Setani. Iwanyama wa kwibagho nawo tsawabahala, na iwamalaika wamtumikila.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kowakema iwanang'ina wa mwanduso</para>
  <para style="r">(Matei 4:12-22; Luka 4:14-15; 5:1-11)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v"/>Yohane hekighwe mchifungo, Yesu kaghenda Galilaya kuwapetela iwanu Imbuli Inoghile ye Imulungu. <verse number="15" style="v"/>Kalonga, “Ichipindi chitsa, Undewa we Imulungu wa habehi. Mtsileke nzambi tsenu muitoghole Imbuli Inoghile.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v"/>Yesu hayang'ali yoghenda mmbalimbali mwe tsimbu Galilaya, kawona iwalowa wasomba weli, Simoni na Andereya, ndughu yake. Tsawang'ali wolowa iwasomba.<figure style="fig" desc="" file="07 Fishing.jpg" size="col" loc="" copy="" ref="1:16">8. Imunu kolowa kwa nyapfu</figure> <verse number="17" style="v"/>Yesu kawalongela, “Mniwinze, nani nitsowatenda mwemwe muwe iwalowa iwanu.” <verse number="18" style="v"/>Bahala watsileka nyapfu tsawo, wamuwinza.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v"/>Kaghenda hatali chidogho, kawona Jakobu na Yohane, iwana wa Sebedayo, wamne mnumbwi ghwawo, wotenda ghoya nyapfu tsawo. <verse number="20" style="v"/>Bahala Yesu hayawonile, kawakema. Nawo wamleka Sebedayo, aba wawo mne mnumbwi hamwe ne iwatenda isang'ano, wamuwinza.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu komlapfa imunu chinyamkela</para>
  <para style="r">(Luka 4:31-37)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v"/>Yesu ne iwanang'ina wake wapfika mne ghumji ghwa Kaperinaumu. Litsuwa lya Sabato, <note caller="c" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1.21 </char><char style="fk">Litsuwa lya Sabato </char> Mana yake litsuwa lyalaghitse Imulungu iwanu wabwihile.</note> Yesu kengila mne ing'anda ye ukulombela, kandusa kulangulitsa. <verse number="22" style="v"/>Iwanu iwamhulikitse wakangawala kwa ghamalangulitso ghake, kwaapfila yeye ng'alangulitse bae ka iwolangulitsa Ghamalaghitso gha Musa, ila kalangulitsa ka imunu yane ukulu.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v"/>Bahala imunu yane ichinyamkela kengila mne ing'anda ye ukulombela kakemelela kwa litsi likulu, <verse number="24" style="v"/>“Ubama kutenda choni, Yesu wa Natsareti? Kutsa kutukoma? Nokumanya ghweghwe kwa Mwenzeluka we Imulungu!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v"/>Yesu kamkembela ichinyamkela, “Nyamale! Umlawe imunu yuno!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v"/>Ichinyamkela ayo tsakamhighitsa kwe ingupfu imunu ayo, kuya kakemelela, kamlawa. <verse number="27" style="v"/>Apfo iwanu wose wakangawala ghendo, weghutsa, “Apfino pfinu pfachi? Agha malangulitso gha sambi? Imunu yuno kana uwetso wa kulapfa ipfinyamkela, nawo womtegheletsa.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v"/>Apfo mbuli tsa Yesu tsenela himahima mne isi yose ya Galilaya.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kowahonetsa iwanu wengi</para>
  <para style="r">(Matei 8:14-17; Luka 4:38-41)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v"/>Yesu ne iwanang'ina wake, hamwe na Jakobu na Yohane walawa mne ing'anda ye ukulombela waghenda ukaye kwa Simoni na Andereya. <verse number="30" style="v"/>Mai mkwe wa Simoni tsakakala kawasa mlusatsi koghula lihoma. Yesu hayapfikile, wamlongela mbuli tse ipinga ayo. <verse number="31" style="v"/>Kamghendela, kamkinda ghumoko kamwinula. Utamu umlawa, kandusa kuwatumikila.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v"/>Mihe haipfikile na litsua kuswa, iwanu wamghalila Yesu iwatamu wose ne iwanu wane ipfinyamkela. <verse number="33" style="v"/>Iwanu wose wa ghumji wetingana hachibwalu he ing'anda. <verse number="34" style="v"/>Yesu kawahonetsa iwanu wane matamu ghoghose na kalapfa ipfinyamkela wengi. Ng'aweng'ile bae ipfinyamkela nyafwasi ye ukulonga chochose kwaapfila tsawammanya yeye nani.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kowapetela iwanu mne isi ya Galilaya</para>
  <para style="r">(Luka 4:42-44)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v"/>Lupfilipfili, litsua ng'ana lilawe, Yesu kenuka, kalawa aho hakaye, kaghenda kunze kwe ghumji, hanu halihela imunu, kamlomba Imulungu. <verse number="36" style="v"/>Simoni na weyaghe waghenda kumbama. <verse number="37" style="v"/>Hawamwonile, wamlongela, “Iwanu wose wokubama ghweghwe.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v"/>Yesu kawedika, “Twobamighwa tughende kune ipfijiji pfingi ipfili habehi. Amo nobamighwa niwapetele iwanu Imbuli Inoghile, kwaapfila acho chicho chanitsilile.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v"/>Apfo Yesu kanga isi yose ya Galilaya, aku kowapetela iwanu mne tsing'anda tsawo tse ukulombela na kulapfa ipfinyamkela.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu komuhonetsa imunu iyoghula ukoma</para>
  <para style="r">(Matei 8:1-4; Luka 5:12-16)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v"/>Imunu yumwe iyoghula ukoma tsakamghendela Yesu. Kamtowela ghamaghoti kamlomba, kalonga, “Ung'abama, kwodaha kunideghetesa.” <note caller="d" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1.40 </char><char style="fk">Kunideghesa </char> Ukoma tsaukala utamu iumghoma imunu kumlomba Imulungu, kwaapfila imunu yane utamu awo tsakakala keha.</note></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v"/>Yesu kamwonela libatsi imunu ayo, kagholosa ghumoko ghwake, kamkinda. Kuya kalonga, “Nobama, degheta!” <verse number="42" style="v"/>Bahala utamu umlawa, kahona.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v"/>Bahala Yesu kamleka yoke aku komkomangitsa ghendo, kamlongela, <verse number="44" style="v"/>“Uleke kumlongela imunu wowose imbuli ino, ila ughende wikelanguse kwe mtambika, ulapfe nambiko ka pfayalaghitse Musa. Kuya yakulanguse kwe iwanu ka kuhona.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v"/>Lekeni imunu ayo koka, kandusa kwenetsa mbuli atso chila hanu, mbaka Yesu ng'adahile bae kughenda mwatsimwatsi mne ghumji. Ila kakala kunze hanu halihela imunu. Lekeni iwanu tsawang'ali womghendela kulawa chila hanu.</para>
  <chapter number="2" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Yesu komuhonetsa imunu iyaholole</para>
  <para style="r">(Matei 9:1-8; Luka 5:17-26)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Ghamatsuwa chidogho hambele, Yesu koya keli Kaperinaumu, na mbuli tsenela kwe iwanu ka tsaka ukaye. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Iwanu wengi wetingana hamwe mbaka kukala kuduhu hokukala, wamema mbaka mne chibwalu. Yesu yang'ali yowapetela imbuli yake. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Baho iwanu wane wapfika, wambapa imunu iyaholole wamghalila Yesu. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Kwaapfila iwanu tsa wengi, ng'awadahile bae kumghala habehi na Yesu. Apfo watobola mchiswili, kuchanya mwe hanu hayakalile Yesu. Baho, wamhulumsa imunu ayo iyawasile mchilagho. <verse number="5" style="v"/>Yesu honile ukutoghola kwawo, kamlongela imunu ayo iyaholole, “Mwanangu, nzambi tsako tsileghusighwa.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v"/>Wangi we iwolangulitsa Ghamalaghitso gha Musa iwakalile baho weghutsa mne imimoyo yawo, <verse number="7" style="v"/>“Angu ichinu chachi ichimtenda alonge pfino? Komligha Imulungu. Imulungu yaliyeka iyo iyodaha kuleghusa nzambi!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v"/>Bahala Yesu kamanya achila chawang'ali wokwalangula mne imimoyo yawo, kawalongela, “Ebali mwakwalangula ipfinu pfino? <verse number="9" style="v"/>Chihi chibewe, kumlongela imunu iyaholole, ‘Nzambi tsako tsileghusighwa,’ au kumlongela, ‘Winuke, usole chilagho chako ughende’? <verse number="10" style="v"/>Nobama mmanye ka Imwana we Imunu kana uwetso wa kuleghusa nzambi muisi.” Baho kamlongela imunu yaholole, <verse number="11" style="v"/>“Nokulongela, winuke, usole chilagho chako uke ukaye!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v"/>Naye kenuka, kasola chilagho chake kaghenda aku iwanu wose womlola. Iwanu wose tsawakangawala, wamtunya Imulungu, walonga, “Ng'ana twone ghendo ichinu ka chino!”</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu komkema Lawi</para>
  <para style="r">(Matei 9:9-13; Luka 5:27-32)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v"/>Yesu kaghenda keli mmbalimbali mwe tsimbu. Iwanu wamghendela, naye kandusa kuwalangulitsa. <verse number="14" style="v"/>Hang'ali yoluta, kamwona Lawi imwana we Alifayo kakala mne ing'anda ya kulihila kodi. Yesu kamlongela, “Niwinze.” Lawi kenuka, kamuwinza.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v"/>Yesu hayang'ali yakuja ichijo cha nemihe mne ing'anda ya Lawi, iwasola kodi wengi na “wane nzambi” tsawakala hasi wang'ali wakuja naye ne wanang'ina wake, kwaapfila tsakukala ne iwanu wengi iwomuwinza. <verse number="16" style="v"/>Iwolangulitsa Ghamalaghitso wamwenga iwakalile Mafarisayo, hawamwonile Yesu kakuja ne “Wane nzambi” ne iwasola kodi, wawaghutsa iwanang'ina wake, “Ebali kakuja ne iwasola kodi na ‘wane nzambi’?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v"/>Yesu kawahulika, kawalongela, “Iwanu iwaghima ng'awombama bae imghanga, ila iwatamu iwo iwombama mghanga. Sitsile bae kuwakema iwanu iwanoghile, ila wane nzambi.”</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu koghutsighwa imbuli ya kufunga ukuja</para>
  <para style="r">(Matei 9:14-17; Luka 5:33-39)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v"/>Iwanafunzi wa Yohane ne iwanang'ina wa Mafarisayo wang'ali wofunga ukuja. Iwanu wangi wamtsila Yesu wamghutsa, “Ebali iwanang'ina wa Yohane ne iwanang'ina wa Mafarisayo wofunga ukuja, lekeni iwanang'ina wako ng'awofunga ukuja bae?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v"/>Yesu kawedika, “Apfi, iwanu iwakemighwe kune ichihungo cha kukwela wodaha kufunga ukuja aku mmale yokwela kabaho hamwe nawo? Ng'awodaha bae kufunga ukuja. <verse number="20" style="v"/>Lekeni ichipindi chakutsa mmale iyokwela katsosolighwa kulawa kuna wawo, na baho watsofunga ukuja. <verse number="21" style="v"/>Kuduhu imunu iyoghana chilaka mne lighwanda lya sambi na kuchidapfalitsa mne lighwanda lya ghumwande, ang'atenda apfo, chilaka cha sambi chitsolihinya lighwanda lya ghumwande na hanu hadegheke hatsakongetseka. <verse number="22" style="v"/>Na kuduhu imunu iyoghuma idipfai ya sambi mne imikoba ye ngotsi ya ghumwande. Ka kotenda apfo, dipfai ya sambi itsoitula imikoba ayo, dipfai itsokwitika ne imikoba itsohinyika. Ila koghuma dipfai ya sambi mne imikoba ya sambi!”</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu koghutsighwa imbuli ya litsuwa lya Sabato</para>
  <para style="r">(Matei 12:1-8; Luka 6:1-5)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v"/>Litsuwa limwe lya sabato, Yesu na wanafunzi wake wang'ali wobita mne imighunda ye uhemba. Hawang'ali woghenda, iwanang'ina wake wandusa kukwanyula imikungwi ye uhemba. <verse number="24" style="v"/>Mafarisayo wamlongela Yesu, “Lola! Ebali wotenda ichinu ichighomighwe mne litsuwa lya Sabato?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v"/>Yesu kawedika, “Pfii ng'amsomile bae pfatendile Daudi na wayaghe hawakalile ne nzala? <verse number="26" style="v"/>Mne ghamatsuwa ghe Imtambika mkulu Abiyatari, Daudi tsakengila mne ing'anda ye Imulungu, kaja pfighate ipfilapfighwe kwe Imulungu, pfighate apfo tsapfibamighwa pfijighwe ne iwapfilongotsi we inambiko waliyeka. Pfipfila kaweng'a wayaghe.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v"/>Kuya Yesu kawalongela, “Litsuwa lya Sabato likighwa kwaajili ye iwanu, na si iwanu bae kwaajili ye Litsuwa lya Sabato.” <verse number="28" style="v"/>Imwana we Imunu ka Imtwatsa wa Litsuwa lya Sabato.</para>
  <chapter number="3" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Yesu komuhonetsa imunu yane ghumoko ighuholole</para>
  <para style="r">(Matei 12:9-14; Luka 6:6-11)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Kuya Yesu kaghenda keli mne ing'anda ye ukulombela. Aho kukala ne imunu yane ghumoko ighuholole. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Iwanu wamwenga wang'ali wobama imbuli ya kumghoghela Yesu. Apfo wamlolesa ka ang'amhonetse imunu ayo mne Litsuwa lya Sabato. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Yesu kamlongela imunu ayo, “Utse hano hambele.” <verse number="4" style="v"/>Kuya kawaghutsa iwanu, “Apfi chihi chinoghile cha kutenda mna litsuwa lya Sabato, kutenda ghanoghile au ghehile? Kuukombola ughima au kuukoma?” Lekeni wawo ng'awalongile chinu chochose bae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v"/>Kawalolesa iwanu kwa maya, baho kona usungu mmoyo mwake, kwa usughu we imimoyo yawo. Kuya kamlongela imunu yula, “Ugholose ghumoko ghwako.” Naye kaghugholosa, na ghumoko ghwake ghuhona. <verse number="6" style="v"/>Apfo Mafarisayo walawa kunze mwe ing'anda ye Imulungu, wetingana ne iwanu wa Herodi wandusa kubama inzila ya kumkoma Yesu.</para>
  <para style="s">Likingili lyomuwinza Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v"/>Yesu ne iwanang'ina wake waghenda kune ghumto Galilaya na iwanu wengi tsawamuwinza, walawila Galilaya na Yudeya. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Hawahulike ghose ghatendile, iwanu wengi wamtsila kulawa Yudeya, Yerusalemu, Idumeya ne ipfijiji ipfili kumwambu mwa ghumto Yoridani ne imiji ya Tiro na Sidoni. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Kwaapfila iwanu wakala wengi, Yesu kawalongela iwanang'ina wake wamwikile ghoya mnumbwi, ili iwanu waleke kumsoghelela. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Kwaapfila tsakawahonetsa iwanu wengi, iwatamu wose wang'ali womsoghelela habehi wamkinde. <verse number="11" style="v"/>Ne iwanu wane ipfinyamkela chila hawamwonile, waghwa hasi hambele hake, wakemelela, “Ghweghwe kwa Imwana we Imulungu.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v"/>Yesu kawaghoma ipfinyamkela waleke kumlongela imunu wowose ka yeye tsanani.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kosaghula iwanang'ina kumi na weli</para>
  <para style="r">(Matei 10:1-4; Luka 6:12-16)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v"/>Yesu kagheluka kuchidunda, kawakema awala iyawabamile mwenyegho, nawo wamghendela. <verse number="14" style="v"/>Naye kawasaghula iwanu kumi na weli, kawakema watumighwa. Kawalongela, “Niwasaghula mwemwe mkale na nene. Kuya nitsowatuma mghende mkawapetele iwanu. <verse number="15" style="v"/>Namwe mtsakuwa na ukulu wa kulapfa ipfinyamkela.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v"/>Awano iwo iwanu kumi na weli iyawasaghule. Simoni, yakemighwe na Yesu taghwa lingi Petiri, <verse number="17" style="v"/>Jakobu na ndughu yake Yohane, iwana wa Sebedayo Yesu tsakaweng'a taghwa Boanerige, mana yake iwana wa mdumo, <verse number="18" style="v"/>Andereya na Filipi, na Batalomeyo, na Matei, na Tomasi, na Jakobu imwana wa Alifayo, na Tadei, na Simoni Mkananayo, <verse number="19" style="v"/>na Yuda Isikarioti, iyamhunduke Yesu.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu na Belisebuli</para>
  <para style="r">(Matei 12:22-32; Luka 11:14-23; 12:10)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v"/>Kuya Yesu kaghenda ukaye, iwanu wengi wetingana keli mbaka Yesu ne iwanang'ina wake ng'awadahile bae ukuja. <verse number="21" style="v"/>Wandughu tsake hawahulike agho, waghenda kumsola kwaapfila tsawalonga, “Kana lukwale.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v"/>Na iwolangulitsa Ghamalaghitso gha Musa iwalawile Yerusalemu walonga, “Kana Belisebuli! Imkulu we ipfinyamkela iyo iyomwing'a ingupfu ya kulapfa ipfinyamkela.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v"/>Yesu kawakema, kawalongela kwa imifano, “Apfi Setani kodahatse kumlapfa Setani? <verse number="24" style="v"/>Undewa wowose ung'eghola wenyegho, ambe wakughwa. <verse number="25" style="v"/>Ka ing'anda yeghola yenyegho, ing'anda ayo itsakughwa. <verse number="26" style="v"/>Apfo ka undewa wa Setani weghola iwenyegho, utsakughwa na kutsigha.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v"/>“Kuduhu imunu iyodaha kwingila mng'anda mwe imunu yane ingupfu na kusola ipfinu pfake, mbaka tanu amwohe imunu ayo. Baho katsodaha kupfisola ipfinu pfake.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v"/>“Nowalongela ghendo, iwanu watsoleghusighwa nzambi tsawo na ghamaligho ghawo ghose kwe Imulungu. <verse number="29" style="v"/>Lekeni imunu wowose iyomligha Ghumuhe ghwe Imulungu ng'odaha bae kuleghusighwa nzambi ayo, kwaapfila katenda nzambi ya ghamatsuwa ghose.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v"/>Yesu tsakalonga apfi kwaapfila iwanu wang'ali wolonga, “Kana chinyamkela.”</para>
  <para style="s">Mai wake Yesu ne iwandughu tsake</para>
  <para style="r">(Matei 12:46-50; Luka 8:19-21)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v"/>Kuya mai wake Yesu ne iwandughu tsake wapfika. Wema kunze, wamtuma imunu mng'anda amkeme. <verse number="32" style="v"/>Iwanu tsawamtsunguluka Yesu. Nawo wamlongela, “Mai wako na ndughu tsako wakunze, wokubama ghweghwe.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v"/>Yesu kawedika, “Apfi mai wangu nani na ndughu tsangu tsina nani?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v"/>Kuya kawalola iwanu iwamtsunguluke, kalonga “Awano hano iwo mai wangu na ndughu tsangu! <verse number="35" style="v"/>Imunu wowose iyotenda aghala ghobama Imulungu, ayo iyo ndughu yangu na lumbu wangu na mai wangu.”</para>
  <chapter number="4" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Imbuli ye imunu iyohanda</para>
  <para style="r">(Matei 13:1-9; Luka 8:4-8)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Yesu kandusa keli kulangulitsa mmbalimbali mwa tsimbu lya Galilaya. Iwanu wengi iwetingane wamtsunguluka mbaka kengila mne mnumbwi na kukala amo. Ne iwanu wose wakala mmbalimbali mwe tsimbu. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Tsakawalangulitsa ipfinu pfingi kwe imifano, na mne ghamalangulitso ghake kawalongela.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v"/>“Mtegheletse, Imunu iyohanda tsimbeghu tsakaghenda kumitsa tsimbeghu. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Hang'ali yomitsa, tsimbeghu tsimwenga tsilaghalila mnzila, pfideghe watsa, watsija. <verse number="5" style="v"/>Tsingi tsilaghalila mne ghamabwe ghane lidongo chidogho. Tsimbeghu tsota himahima, kwaapfila lidongo tsachidogho. <verse number="6" style="v"/>Litsua halilawile, liilakatsa imimeya kwaapfila imitsisi ng'aighendese hasi bae. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Tsimbeghu tsingi tsilaghalila mne tsimiwa, tsikula na tsihinyighwa na tsimiwa, apfo ng'atseleke bae. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Lekeni tsimbeghu tsingi tsilaghalila mne lidongo linoghile. Imimeya yota, ikula na yeleka tsimbeghu, ingi makumi madatu, ingi makumi sita ne ingi miya imwe.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v"/>Kuya Yesu kalonga, “Imunu yane ghamaghutwi gha kuhulika, yahulike.”</para>
  <para style="s">Mana ye imbuli</para>
  <para style="r">(Matei 13:10-17; Luka 8:9-10)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v"/>Yesu hayakalile aliyeka, iwanang'ina kumi na weli ne iwanu wangi wamghutsa imbuli ayo ilonga choni. <verse number="11" style="v"/>Yesu kawalongela, “Mwemwe mwing'ighwa imbuli ifisighwe ya Undewa we Imulungu. Lekeni awala iwali kunze, wohulika ipfinu kwe imifano <verse number="12" style="v"/>ili,</para>
  <para style="q">‘Walole, lekeni waleke kwona,</para>
  <para style="q">wahulike, lekeni waleke kumanya.</para>
  <para style="q">wang'amanyile, wang'oyile kwe Imulungu,</para>
  <para style="q">naye yang'awaleghusila nzambi tsawo.’ ”</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kolonga imbuli ye imunu yohanda ilongatse</para>
  <para style="r">(Matei 13:18-23; Luka 8:11-15)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v"/>Kuya Yesu kawaghutsa, “Apfi mwemwe ng'ammanyile bae mbuli ino? Lelo mtsomanyatse imbuli yoyose? <verse number="14" style="v"/>Imunu iyohanda kohanda Imbuli ye Imulungu. <verse number="15" style="v"/>Iwanu wangi weghala na tsimbeghu itsilaghalile mnzila. Hawohulika Imbuli ye Imulungu, Setani kakutsa na kuisola imbuli ihandighwe mghati mwawo. <verse number="16" style="v"/>Iwanu wangi weghala na tsimbeghu itsilaghalile mne ghamabwe. Baho hawohulika imbuli ye Imulungu, woibokela kwa kudeng'elela. <verse number="17" style="v"/>Lekeni kwaapfila wahela imitsitsi, wodudumila chidogho. Ukughaya au ukughanzika kung'alawila kwaajili ye imbuli ye Imulungu, baho woileka. <verse number="18" style="v"/>Iwanu wangi weghala na tsimbeghu itsilaghalile mne tsimiwa. Wohulika imbuli, <verse number="19" style="v"/>lekeni Sang'ano tse isi ino na kubama tsimali na kusulukila ipfinu pfingi, pfakwingila mghati mwawo na kuihinya imbuli ye Imulungu, ng'aikweleka bae. <verse number="20" style="v"/>Lekeni iwanu wangi weghala na tsimbeghu itsilaghalile mne lidongo linoghile. Wohulika imbuli ye Imulungu, woitoghola na wakweleka, wangi selasini, wangi sitini, na wangi miya imwe.”</para>
  <para style="s">Chitasa ichighubikighwe</para>
  <para style="r">(Luka 8:16-18)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v"/>Yesu kaghendelela kulonga, “Apfi kuna imunu iyoghala chitasa mng'anda na kuchighubika ne ichiha au kuchika kumpfungu mwe lusatsi? Apfi ng'ochika hanu ha kwikila chitasa, bae? <verse number="22" style="v"/>Kwaapfila ichinu chochose ichipfisighwe chitsakoneka, ne ichinu chochose ichighubikighwe chitsoghubulighwa. <verse number="23" style="v"/>Yane ghamaghutwi gha kuhulika, yahulike.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v"/>Pfipfila kawalongela, “Mtegheletse ghoya chamuhulika! Ghamalaghitso ghamuwahighila iwanu wangi, Imulungu katsowahighila ghamalaghitso ghagho, kuya mtsakongetsighwa. <verse number="25" style="v"/>Kwaapfila imunu yane ichinu katsakongetsighwa ne imunu yalihela ichinu, katsobokighwa hata ichinu chidodo chayenacho.”</para>
  <para style="s">Imbuli ye imbeghu ikota</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v"/>Yesu kaghendelela kulonga, “Undewa we Imulungu weghala pfino. Imunu kopwililisa tsimbeghu kumghunda. <verse number="27" style="v"/>Nechilo kowasa, nemisi kameso. Tsimbeghu tsakota na kukula, naye ng'omanya bae ichitendeka. <verse number="28" style="v"/>Lidongo lyenyegho lyotenda imimeya ikule na kweleka, tanu yotula, yolapfa imbelewele, kuya yakweleka. <verse number="29" style="v"/>Uhemba hauwela, imunu ayo kosenga kwa sengo yake, kwaapfila ichipindi cha kupfuna chipfika.”<figure style="fig" desc="" file="12 Sickle.jpg" size="col" loc="" copy="" ref="4:29">Imunu kopfuna kwa sengo yake</figure></para>
  <para style="s">Imbuli ye imbeghu ya haladali</para>
  <para style="r">(Matei 13:31-32,34; Luka 13:18-19)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v"/>Yesu kalonga keli, “Apfi Undewa we Imulungu weghala ne ichinu chachi? Apfi tutsolonga kwe imbuli yachi? <verse number="31" style="v"/>Weghala ne imbeghu ya haladali, imbeghu ndodo kubita tsimbeghu tsose itsihandighwa mne isi. <verse number="32" style="v"/>Lekeni ing'ahandighwa, yokula na yakuwa mmeya mkulu kubita imimeya yose mne mghunda, nayo yakuwa na ghamaputila makulu ng'ani mbaka wapfideghe wodaha kutsenga ipfibali mne ghamaputila ghake.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v"/>Yesu kawapetela iwanu imbuli yake kwa mbuli nyingi itsighalile na tsino, kawalongela ka pfawadahile kuhulika. <verse number="34" style="v"/>Ng'alongile nawo bae ichinu chochose bila ye imbuli. Lekeni hawakalile ne iwanang'ina wake waliyeka, kawalongela chila ichinu.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu koikembela inyahemu</para>
  <para style="r">(Matei 8:23-27; Luka 8:22-25)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v"/>Litsuwa alyo nemihe, Yesu kawalongela iwanang'ina wake, “Tuloke kumwambu kwa tsimbu.” <verse number="36" style="v"/>Tsawawaleka iwanu, iwanang'ina wengila mne mnumbwi mwakalile Yesu, wamsola woka naye. Pfipfila tsakukala na minumbwi ingi. <verse number="37" style="v"/>Inyahemu ilawila na ghamawimbi ghautowa mnumbwi mbaka ghwandusa kumema ghamatsi.<figure style="fig" desc="" file="09 Boat in Storm.jpg" size="col" loc="" copy="" ref="4:37">Inyahemu youtowa mnumbwi</figure> <verse number="38" style="v"/>Yesu tsakakala kuchughu kwa mnumbwi kawasila ghumto. Iwanang'ina wake wamlamsa, wamlongela, “Mlangulitsi, apfi ng'aukona usungu bae, ka twetwe twotsama?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v"/>Yesu kalamka, kalikembela libeho na kaghalongela ghamawimbi, “Nyamala!”, kuya libeho linyamala na kukala kutindiwala.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v"/>Kuya kawalongela iwanang'ina wake, “Ule mpfuka? Pfii, mng'ali ng'amtoghola bae?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v"/>Nawo wapfuka ghendo, weghutsa, “Ayu munu wachi, libeho na ghamawimbi ghose ghomhulikitsa?”</para>
  <chapter number="5" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Yesu komuhonetsa Imunu yane ipfinyamkela</para>
  <para style="r">(Matei 8:28-34; Luka 8:26-39)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Yesu ne iwanang'ina wake wapfika kumwambu kwa tsimbu Galilaya mne isi ya Gerasi. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Baho Yesu hayalawile mne mnumbwi, ketingana ne imunu yane ichinyamkela yalawile kune tsikaburi. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Imunu ayo tsakakala kune tsikaburi na kuduhu imunu yadahile kumwoha keli hata kwe iminyororo. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Kwaapfila tsakohighwa ghamoko na ghamaghulu ghake, lekeni tsakadumla iminyororo na kubena tsimingu itsili mmaghulu mwake. Na kuduhu imunu yane ingupfu yadahile kumghogha. <verse number="5" style="v"/>Imisi ne ichilo tsayang'ali yakwanga mne tsikaburi na mpfidunda, aku kokemelela na kwighanaghana kwa ghamabwe.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v"/>Hayamwonile Yesu kwa kutali, kamtsumila, kamtowela maghoti hambele hake. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Kalila kwa litsi likulu, kalonga, “Yesu Imwana we Imulungu iyali kuchanya ng'ani ubama choni kuna nene? Kwa taghwa lye Imulungu, nokulomba uleke kunidununza!” <verse number="8" style="v"/>Kalonga apfo kwaapfila Yesu tsakamlongela, “Chinyamkela, lawa mne imunu yuno!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v"/>Kuya Yesu kamghutsa, “Taghwa lyako nani?”</para>
  <para style="p">Naye kamwidika “Taghwa lyangu Kingili, mana twawengi.” <verse number="10" style="v"/>Kuya kamlomba Yesu aleke kuwawinga kunze kwe isi ila pfinyamkela awo.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v"/>Tsakukala na kingili kulu lye iwangubi wakuja habehi na chidunda. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Apfo ipfinyamkela wamlomba Yesu, “Utughale kune iwangubi, utulekelele twingile mna wawo.” <verse number="13" style="v"/>Yesu kawalekelela, ne ipfinyamkela awo wamlawa imunu ayo na kwingila mne iwangubi. Likingili lyose lye iwangubi 2,000 watsumila kune tsimbu na kutsama mne ghamatsi.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v"/>Iwadimi we iwangubi watsuma na kuwalongela iwanu mne ghumji na mne imighunda. Ne iwanu waghenda kulola achila ichilawile. <verse number="15" style="v"/>Hawapfikile kwa Yesu, wamwona imunu yula yakalile na likingili lye ipfinyamkela kakala hasi, kapfala ghamaghwanda ghake na tsimbutsi tsake tsimuyila, iwanu wose wapfuka. <verse number="16" style="v"/>Ne iwanu iwonile ichinu acho wawalongela iwanu ichinu ichimlawile imunu ayo ne iwangubi.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v"/>Kuya iwanu wamlomba Yesu yoke mne ghumji ghwawo.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v"/>Yesu hayakalile kodina mne mnumbwi, imunu iyakalile ne ipfinyamkela kamlomba Yesu woke wose.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v"/>Lekeni Yesu kalema, kamlongela, “Ghenda ukaye kune iwandughu tsako na uwalongele pfakutendele Imtwatsa na pfakwonele libatsi.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v"/>Apfo imunu ayo koka Dekapoli kuwalongela achila Yesu chamtendele. Ne iwanu wose iwahulike tsawakangawala.</para>
  <para style="s">Imwana ipinga wa Yairo ne ipinga iyakindile lighwanda lya Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(Matei 9:18-26; Luka 8:40-56)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v"/>Yesu hayalokile keli kumwambu kwe tsimbu, likingili lye iwanu litingana na limtsunguluka aho hambalimbali ha tsimbu. <verse number="22" style="v"/>Kuya imkulu yumwe we ing'anda ya ukulombela iyakemighwe Yairo tsakatsa, hayamwonile Yesu, keghwisa mmaghulu mwake, <verse number="23" style="v"/>kamlomba “Imwanangu mdodo pinga koghula ng'ani. Nokulomba utse, umwikile ghamoko ghako ahone na yawe mghima.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v"/>Apfo Yesu kaghenda naye. Na likingili lye iwanu limuwinza na kumkunughitsa kunughitsa.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v"/>Baho tsakukala ne ipinga yumwe yane utamu we kulawa idamu kwa miyaka kumi na mili. <verse number="26" style="v"/>Ipinga ayo tsakadununzika ghendo kughenda kwe iwaghanga na kaghisa ipfinu pfake pfose, lekeni ng'apatile ng'apfu bae na kaghendelela kughula. <verse number="27" style="v"/>Ipinga ayo hayahulike mbuli tsa Yesu, kabita mne likingili, kamghendela Yesu kwa kuchughu na kukinda ghwanda lyake, <verse number="28" style="v"/>na kelongela imwenyegho “Ning'akinda ghwanda lyake nitsohona.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v"/>Hayakindile lighwanda lyake, bahala idamu ileka kumlawa, naye kamanya mne lukuli lwake ka utamu wake uhona. <verse number="30" style="v"/>Bahala Yesu kamanya ingupfu imlawa, apfo kahunduka mne kingili na kughutsa, “Apfi imunu wachi yakindile lighwanda lyangu?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v"/>Iwanang'ina wake wamwidika “Kwakona iwanu pfawokukunughitsa kunughitsa, kuya kwotughutsa ‘Apfi imunu wachi yanikindile?’ ”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v"/>Lekeni Yesu kaghendelela kulolesa yamwone imunu wachi iyatendile ichinu acho. <verse number="33" style="v"/>Ipinga ayo kamanya ichinu ichimlawile, apfo kamghendela, kodedema kwa kupfuka na kamghwila mmaghulu mwake, kuya kamlongela ghose. <verse number="34" style="v"/>Yesu kamlongela “Imwanangu, ukutoghola kwako kukuhonetsa. Ughende tseghamba na utamu wako uhone.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v"/>Yesu hayang'ali yolonga apfo, iwanu wangi watsa kulawa mne ing'anda ya Yairo, imkulu we ing'anda ya ukulombela wamlongela, “Imwanagho ma kafa, ebali kwoghendela kumdesa imlangulitsi?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v"/>Yesu hayahulike ichinu chawalongile, kabetsa, kamlongela imkulu we ing'anda ya ukulombela, “Leka kupfuka, ghweghwe toghola.” <verse number="37" style="v"/>Kuya Yesu ng'abamile bae imunu wowose amuwinze, ila kaghenda na Petiri, Jakobu na Yohane, ndughu yake Jakobu. <verse number="38" style="v"/>Hawapfikile mne ing'anda ya Yairo, Yesu tsakona tsogho na kahulika iwanu wolila. <verse number="39" style="v"/>Yesu kengila mng'anda kawalongela, “Ebali mwotenda tsogho na kulila? Imwana ng'afile bae ila kawasa.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v"/>Lekeni wamseka, apfo kawalapfa kunze, kawasola aba na mai wa imwana ayo ne iwanang'ina wake iyakalile nawo, wengila mne chiheleto chawasile imwana. <verse number="41" style="v"/>Kamkinda ghumoko kamlongela “Talita kumi!” mana yake, “Mwana mdodo pinga, nokulongela lamka!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v"/>Bahala imwana kenuka na kandusa kughenda (imwana ayo tsakakala na miyaka kumi na mili). Ichinu achi hachilawile, iwanu wakangawala ghendo. <verse number="43" style="v"/>Yesu kawakanya ghendo waleke kumlongela imunu wowose ichinu ichilawile, kuya kawalongela wamwing'e imwana yula ichijo yaje.</para>
  <chapter number="6" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Yesu kolemighwa ako Natsareti</para>
  <para style="r">(Matei 13:53-58; Luka 4:16-30)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Yesu kalawa hanu aho kaghenda kune ghumji ghwake ne iwanang'ina wake wamuwinza. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Mne litsuwa lya Sabato, kandusa kulangulitsa mne Ing'anda ye ukulombela, iwanu wengi iwamhulikitse wakangawala. Waghutsa, “Angu aghapatile kwani agha ghose? Ne ihekima yachi yeng'ighwe yuno mbaka atende ipfinu pfa kukangawatsa?” <verse number="3" style="v"/>Ayuno si yula msongola mibiki bae imwanaghe Mariya, ne iwandughu tsake tsina Jakobu, Yosefu, Yuda na Simoni, na lumbu tsake ng'awalibaha bae na twetwe? Apfo wamlema.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v"/>Yesu kawalongela, “Manabii wohulikitsighwa chila hanu, ila ng'awohulikitsighwa bae mne imiji yawo na mghati mwa iwandughu tsawo, na mkaye mwawo iwenyegho.” <verse number="5" style="v"/>Yesu ng'adahile bae kutenda pfinu pfa kukangawatsa ako, ila kawekila ghamoko iwatamu chidogho, kawahonetsa. <verse number="6" style="v"/>Yesu tsakakangawala ng'ani kwa ukulema kwawo kutoghola.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kowatuma iwanang'ina kumi na weli.</para>
  <para style="r">(Matei 10:5-15; Luka 9:1-6)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v"/>Kuya Yesu kanga mne ipfijiji apfila kuwalangulitsa iwanu. Kawakema hamwe iwanang'ina wake kumi na weli, kawatuma weliweli na kaweng'a ukulu wa kuwalapfa ipfinyamkela. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Kuya kawalongela, “Mleke kusola ichinu chochose kwaajili ya ghumwanza, ila ing'weku iliyeka. Mleke kusola pfighate, imikoba ya ghamaghwanda wala sendi. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Mpfale imikwabatsa, mleke kughala lighwanda lingi. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Ing'anda yoyose yamtsakwingila, mkale baho mbaka hamtsakuka. <verse number="11" style="v"/>Na hanu hohose iwanu hawolema kuwabokela au kuwategheletsa, mlawe hanu aho na mkung'use litimbwisi mmaghulu mwenu ka ukalangama kuna wawo.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v"/>Apfo tsawoka na kuwapetela iwanu watsileke nzambi tsawo. <verse number="13" style="v"/>Tsawalapfa ipfinyamkela wengi na kuwabaka ghamafuta iwatamu wengi, wawahonetsa.</para>
  <para style="s">Ukufa kwa Yohane Mbatitsa</para>
  <para style="r">(Matei 14:1-12; Luka 9:7-9)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v"/>Imndewa Herodi kahulika mbuli atso, kwaapfila taghwa lya Yesu tsalimanyika chila hanu. Iwanu wangi walonga, “Yohane Mbatitsa katsilihuka. Ndo mana kana ngupfu tsa ukutenda ipfinu pfa kukangawatsa.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v"/>Lekeni wangi walonga, “Ayuno Eliya.”</para>
  <para style="p">Na wangi walonga, “Ayuno nabii ka wala manabii wa ghumwande.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v"/>Herodi hayahulike apfo, kalonga, “Yohane iyanimghanile litwi katsilihuka!” <verse number="17" style="v"/>Kwaapfila Herodi imwenyegho tsakalaghitsa Yohane yaghoghighwe, yekighwe mne chifungo. Tsakatenda apfo kwaajili ya Herodiya mwehe wake, ipinga ayo tsakakala mwehe wa ndughu yake Filipi. <verse number="18" style="v"/>Yohane Mbatitsa tsakaghendelela kumlongela Herodi, “Ng'apfinoghile bae ghweghwe kumkwela mwehe wa ndughu yako.” <verse number="19" style="v"/>Naye Herodiya tsakamhila Yohane na kabama amkome. Lekeni ng'adahile bae kwaajili ya Herodi. <verse number="20" style="v"/>Herodi tsakampfuka Yohane kwaapfila kamanya Yohane kakala imunu yanoghile na yenzeluke, apfo yang'ali yomlolesa. Tsayang'ali yonoghela kumhulikitsa, hata ka tsayang'ali yoghanzika ng'ani hayomalitsa kumhulikitsa.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v"/>Litsuwa limwe, Herodiya tsakapata nafasi mne ichihungo cha kwelekighwa kwa Herodi. Herodi tsakawatendela ichihungo iwatawala, iwakulu we asikali na ipfilongotsi we isi ya Galilaya. <verse number="22" style="v"/>Neghe Herodiya hayengile tsakapfina, kamdeng'elesa Herodi ne iwahenza wake. Apfo imndewa kamlongela imwana ayo, “Unilombe ichinu chochose chaubama, nitsokwing'a.” <verse number="23" style="v"/>Kelaha, “Nitsokwing'a chochose chaubama, hata ka inusu ya undewa wangu!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v"/>Kuya imwana ayo kaghenda kumghutsa mai wake, “Nilombe choni?”</para>
  <para style="p">Naye kamwidika, “Lomba litwi lya Yohane Mbatitsa.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v"/>Imwana ayo katsuma mbaka kwa imndewa kamlomba, “Nobama ungaye litwi lya Yohane Mbatitsa mne lungo!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v"/>Imndewa kona usungu ng'ani, lekeni ng'adahile bae kulema, kwaapfila tsakelaha hambele he iwahenza wake. <verse number="27" style="v"/>Bahala imndewa kamlaghitsa asikali, kamlongela aghale litwi lya Yohane. Asikali kaghenda mne chifungo, kamghana litwi Yohane. <verse number="28" style="v"/>Kuya kaghala litwi alyo mne lungo, kamwing'a imwana ayo. Naye kamwing'a mai wake. <verse number="29" style="v"/>Iwanang'ina wa Yohane hawahulike apfi, waghenda kulusola lukuli lwake, walutsika.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu koweng'a ichijo iwanu 5,000.</para>
  <para style="r">(Matei 14:13-21; Luka 9:10-17; Yohane 6:1-14)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v"/>Iwatumighwa woya na wetingana kwa Yesu, wamlongela aghala ghose ghawatendile na kulangulitsa. <verse number="31" style="v"/>Yesu kawalongela, “Leka tughende tuliyeka hanu halihela imunu tukabwihile.” Kalonga apfo kwaapfila tsakukala ne iwanu wengi iwang'ali wakutsa na ukuka, mbaka Yesu ne iwanang'ina wake ng'awadahile bae kupata nafasi ya ukuja ichijo. <verse number="32" style="v"/>Apfo woka waliyeka mne mnumbwi, waghenda hanu halihela imunu.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v"/>Lekeni iwanu iwawonile hawang'ali wakuka, tsawamanya. Apfo watsuma kwa mghulu kulawa mne imiji yose, kuya walongola kupfika. <verse number="34" style="v"/>Yesu hayalawile mne mnumbwi, kona mtingano mkulu ghwe iwanu, kawonela libatsi kwaapfila tsawoneka ka iwang'olo iwalihela mdimi. Apfo kandusa kuwalangulitsa ipfinu pfingi.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v"/>Mihe haipfikile, iwanang'ina wake wamghendela wamlongela, “Hanu hano hana nyika iliyeka, na litsua liswa. <verse number="36" style="v"/>Waleke woke kune imighunda ne ipfijiji, ili wakeghulile ichijo iwenyegho.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v"/>Lekeni kawedika, “Mwemwe muweng'e ichijo waje.”</para>
  <para style="p">Wamghutsa, “Apfi kwotubama tughende tukawaghulile pfighate pfa sendi miya mbili tuweng'e waje?” <verse number="38" style="v"/>Kawaghutsa, “Mna pfighate pfingapi? Mghende mkalole.”</para>
  <para style="p">Hawamanyile, wamlongela “Kuna pfighate pfitano ne iwasomba weli.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v"/>Kuya Yesu kawalongela iwanang'ina wake, wawalongele iwanu wose weghole mne makingili, wakale hasi mne mitsani imibisi. <verse number="40" style="v"/>Apfo wakala mne makingili ghe iwanu, hano miya, hano hamsini. <verse number="41" style="v"/>Kuya Yesu kasola pfighate pfila pfitano ne iwasomba weli, kalola kulanga, kapfibaliki kuya kapfibena pfighate pfila. Kaweng'a iwanang'ina wake waweng'e iwanu. Pfipfila kawagholela iwanu wose iwasomba wala weli. <verse number="42" style="v"/>Iwanu wose waja weghuta, <verse number="43" style="v"/>ne iwanang'ina wake wadondola pfighate ne iwasomba yawakalile wamemetsa pfiseghe kumi na pfili. <verse number="44" style="v"/>Iwamale iwajile wakala 5000.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu koghenda mchanya mwa ghamatsi.</para>
  <para style="r">(Matei 14:22-33; Yohane 6:15-21)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v"/>Bahala Yesu kawalongela iwanang'ina wake wengile mne mnumbwi wamlongolele kughenda Betisaida. Yeye tsayang'ali kowaagha iwanu woke. <verse number="46" style="v"/>Hayamalitse kuwaagha iwanu, kaghenda mlughongo kulomba. <verse number="47" style="v"/>Mihe haipfikile, mnumbwi ghukala mghati mwe tsimbu naye kakala aliyeka kunze kwe tsimbu. <verse number="48" style="v"/>Tsakawona iwanang'ina wake woghaya mne mnumbwi, kwaapfila libeho ling'ali lyowatowa kwa ingupfu. Habehi na kucha, kawaghendela, yang'ali yoghenda mchanya mwe ghamatsi. Kabama awalute, <verse number="49" style="v"/>nawo hawamwonile koghenda mchanya mwe ghamatsi, tsawepfikitsa tsakakala mtsimu. Walila kwa litsi likulu, <verse number="50" style="v"/>kwaapfila wose tsawamwona na wang'ali wopfuka.</para>
  <para style="p">Bahala Yesu kawalongela, “Nene! Mleke kupfuka.” <verse number="51" style="v"/>Kuya kengila mne mnumbwi hamwe nawo, na libeho linyamala, iwanang'ina wake wakangawala ghendo. <verse number="52" style="v"/>Kwaapfila ng'awamanyile bae mbuli tsa pfighate, imimoyo yawo tsaikala mikomu.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kowahonetsa iwatamu ako Genesareti.</para>
  <para style="r">(Matei 14:34-36)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v"/>Waloka tsimbu, wapfika mne isi ya Genesareti, baho wemitsa imnumbwi ghwawo. <verse number="54" style="v"/>Hawalawile mne mnumbwi, bahala iwanu wamtanga Yesu. <verse number="55" style="v"/>Apfo watsuma mne isi yose, wandusa kuwasola iwatamu mne ghamasatsi na kuwaghala hanu hohose kuwahulike Yesu kabaho. <verse number="56" style="v"/>Na chila hanu kwayaghendile, mne ipfijiji, imiji au kumighunda, waweka iwatamu mne ghamasoko. Wamlomba awaleke wakinde hata mindo ya lighwanda lyake, na wose iwamkindile tsawahona.</para>
  <chapter number="7" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Ichihile ne ichideghete</para>
  <para style="r">(Matei 15:1-9)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Mafarisayo wangi na iwolangulitsa Ghamalaghitso iwalawile Yerusalemu, wetingana hambele ha Yesu. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Wawona iwanang'ina wake wamwenga wakuja ichijo bila kwohopfugha ghamoko ghawo.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v"/>Mafarisayo na Wayahudi wose ng'awakuja bae ichijo mbaka wahopfughe ghamoko ghawo mbaka mne pfipfughumu, tsawakinda ichihendo cha iwabala wawo. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Hawolawa kusoko ng'awakuja ichinu chochose mbaka wachihopfughe. Pfipfila tsawakinda ipfihendo pfingi ka kuhopfugha ipfikombe, ghamabigha na pfiha.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v"/>Apfo awala Mafarisayo na iwolangulitsa Ghamalaghitso wamghutsa Yesu, “Ebali iwanang'ina wako ng'awokinda bae ipfihendo pfa iwabala, ila wakuja kwa ghamoko ghehile?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v"/>Yesu kawedika, “Isaya tsakatabili pfinoghile kuna mwemwe, mwemwe iwang'enye, ka pfandike.</para>
  <para style="q">‘Iwanu wano wonihulikitsa kwa imilomo yawo,</para>
  <para style="q">lekeni imimoyo yawo yakutali na nene.</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v"/>Wonitamanila hela,</para>
  <para style="q">wolangulitsa ghamalaghitso ghe iwanu,</para>
  <para style="q">ka ghamalaghitso ghe Imulungu!’</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v"/>“Mleka ghamalaghitso ghe Imulungu,</para>
  <para style="q">mwokinda ipfihendo pfe iwanu.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v"/>Kuya kawalongela, “Pfinogha! Mna inzila inoghile ya kulema ghamalaghitso ghe Imulungu ili mkinde ipfihendo pfenu. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Musa tsakalonga, ‘Uwahulike aba wako na mai wako,’ na ‘Imunu wowose iyomligha aba wake au mai wake katsokufa.’ <verse number="11" style="v"/>Lekeni mwemwe mwolangulitsa, ka imunu kana ichinu cha kumwapfila aba wake au mai wake lekeni kolonga, ‘Ichinu achi Koribani’ mana yake, nzawadi kwe Imulungu, <verse number="12" style="v"/>apfo ng'obamighwa keli kumwapfila aba wake au mai wake. <verse number="13" style="v"/>Apfo mwoibetsa imbuli ye Imulungu kwe ipfihendo pfenu pfambokele. Na mwotenda ipfinu pfingi ka apfo.”</para>
  <para style="s">Ipfinu ipfimtenda imunu yehe</para>
  <para style="r">(Matei 15:10-20)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v"/>Kuya Yesu kalikema keli kingili lila lye iwanu, kawalongela, “Mnitegheletse mwemwe wose, mmanye. <verse number="15" style="v"/>Kuduhu ichinu ichikwingila mghati mwe imunu kulawa kunze ichidaha kumtenda yehe. Lekeni ichilawa mghati mwe imunu, acho chomtenda imunu yehe. <verse number="16" style="v"/>Imunu yane ghamaghutwi gha kuhulika na yahulike.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v"/>Halilekile kingili lye iwanu na kwingila mng'anda, iwanang'ina wake wamghutsa mana ye imbuli ayo. <verse number="18" style="v"/>Yesu kawalongela, “Apfi namwe mwahela tsimbutsi? Angu ng'ammanya bae ka kuduhu ichinu ichimwingila imunu kulawa kunze chimtende yehe? <verse number="19" style="v"/>Kwaapfila ng'achimwingila bae mne ghumoyo ila chakwingila munda, kuya cholawa kunze kwe lukuli lwake.” Kwa ukulonga apfi, Yesu kapfitenda ipfijo pfose “pfinogha.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v"/>Kaghendelela kulonga, “Ichinu ichimlawa imunu, acho chomtenda yehe. <verse number="21" style="v"/>Kwaapfila mne ghumoyo ghwe imunu, gholawa mawatso ghehile, utsinzi, ubapfi, ukukoma, dong'o, <verse number="22" style="v"/>ughoni, ughutsu, ufisadi, chepfu, maligho, kwighoda, chidandali ne ubotsi. <verse number="23" style="v"/>Agho ghose ghehile gholawa mghati mwe imunu, nagho ghomtenda imunu yehe.”</para>
  <para style="s">Ukutoghola kwe ipinga</para>
  <para style="r">(Matei 15:21-28)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v"/>Yesu kalawa hanu aho, kaghenda mne ghumji ghwa Tiro. Ako kengila mne ing'anda na ng'abamile bae imunu wowose amanye, lekeni ng'adahile bae kwipfisa. <verse number="25" style="v"/>Ipinga yumwe iyakalile ne imwana pinga yane ichinyamkela, kahulika mbuli tsa Yesu. Apfo kamghendela, kamghwila mmaghulu mwake. <verse number="26" style="v"/>Ipinga ayo tsakakala Mgiriki, iyelekighwe mne ghumji ghwa Sirofoinike. Kamlomba Yesu amlapfe mwanaghe ichinyamkela. <verse number="27" style="v"/>Lekeni Yesu kamwidika, “Tanu waleke iwana weghute. Ng'apfinoghile bae kusola ichijo che iwana na kuwasila wambwa.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v"/>Ipinga ayo kamwidika, “Imtwatsa, lekeni hata wambwa iwali hasi mwe imetsa wakuja ipfijo pfawalekile iwana.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v"/>Yesu kamlongela ipinga yula, “Kwa apfo pfawidike, uke ukaye, ichinyamkela kamlawa imwanagho.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v"/>Apfo ipinga yula koka ukaye, kampfika imwanaghe kawasa mne lusatsi na ichinyamkela kamlawa.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu komuhonetsa imunu iyali chitsiwi na chibubu.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v"/>Kuya Yesu koka mne ghumji ghwa Tiro, kaghenda Galilaya kwa kubitila Sidoni na mne ghumji ghwa Dekapoli. <verse number="32" style="v"/>Iwanu wangi wamghalila imunu chitsiwi na iyang'adahile bae ukulonga pfinoghile, wamlomba Yesu amwikile ghamoko imunu ayo. <verse number="33" style="v"/>Apfo Yesu kamseghetsa imunu ayo hambali ne iwanu. Keka pfidole pfake mne ghamaghutwi ghe imunu ayo. Kuya kabwalula ghamate na kaludonza lulimi lwake. <verse number="34" style="v"/>Yesu kalola kulanga, kahumula kwe ingupfu, kamlongela imunu ayo, “Epfata!” (mana yake, “Ghubuka!”).</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v"/>Bahala ghamaghutwi ghe imunu yula ghaghubuka, lulimi lwake luleghela, kandusa kulonga pfinoghile. <verse number="36" style="v"/>Kuya Yesu kawalaghitsa waleke kumlongela imunu wowose. Lekeni ka pfayaghendelele kuwaghoma, waghendelela kulalatsa mbuli ayo. <verse number="37" style="v"/>Iwanu wakangawala ghendo. Walonga, “Katenda ghoya chila ichinu. Hata pfitsiwi kowatenda wahulike, na pfibubu walonge!”</para>
  <chapter number="8" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Yesu kowaghutitsa iwanu elufu nne</para>
  <para style="r">(Matei 15:32-39)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Mne ghamatsuwa agho, kingili lingi likulu litingana. Kwaapfila tsawakala wahela ichijo, Yesu kawakema iwanang'ina wake, kawalongela, <verse number="2" style="v"/>“Nowonela libatsi iwanu wano, kwaapfila wakala na nene kwa ghamatsuwa madatu bila ukuja. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Ning'awalongela woke mmakaye mwawo ne inzala, wodaha kutsilika mnzila, kwaapfila wangi wolawa kutali.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v"/>Iwanang'ina wake wamghutsa, “Apfi hano kunyika imunu kodaha kupata kwani ichijo chokuweng'a iwanu wose wano waghute?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v"/>Yesu kawaghutsa, “Mna pfighate pfingapi?”</para>
  <para style="p">Wamwidika, “Saba.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v"/>Yesu kawalongela iwanu wakale hasi. Kasola pfighate pfila saba, kapfibaliki, kapfibena na kuweng'a iwanang'ina wake waweng'e iwanu, nawo watenda pfipfo. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Pfipfila tsawakala ne iwasomba wadowado chidogho. Yesu kawabaliki pfipfila na kuwalongela iwanang'ina wake waweng'e iwanu. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Iwanu waja na kwighuta. Kuya iwanang'ina wake wadondola pfiseghe saba ipfimemile ipfijo ipfisighale. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Iwanu iwajile tsawakala elufu nne. Kuya Yesu kawaagha, <verse number="10" style="v"/>bahala kengila mne mnumbwi ne iwanang'ina wake, kaghenda mne ghumji ghwa Dalamanuta.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v"/>Mafarisayo wangi wamghendela na wandusa kumghutsa. Wamghetsa, wabama chitango kulawa kulanga. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Tsakwona usungu mne ghumoyo ghwake, kalonga, “Ebali mweleko ghuno ghwobama ichitango? Nowalongela ghendo, ng'awatsakwing'ighwa ichitango chochose.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v"/>Kuya kawaleka, kengila mne mnumbwi, kaloka kaghenda kumwambu.</para>
  <para style="s">Hamila ya Mafarisayo na Herodi.</para>
  <para style="r">(Matei 16:5-12)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v"/>Iwanang'ina tsawesemwa kughala pfighate, wakala na chighate chimwe chiliyeka mne mnumbwi. <verse number="15" style="v"/>Yesu kawakanya, kawalongela, “Mwalangitse ne hamila ya Mafarisayo na ya Herodi!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v"/>Wandusa kwilongela iwenyegho, “Kalonga apfi kwaapfila twahela chighate.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v"/>Yesu tsakamanya chawang'ali wolonga. Kawaghutsa, “Ebali mwelongela iwenyegho, kwaapfila mwahela chighate? Mng'ali ng'ammanya au kutanga? Apfi imimoyo yenu mikomu? <verse number="18" style="v"/>Mna tsinenge ng'amkwona bae, na mna ghamaghutwi ng'amhulika bae? Na ng'amkumbuka bae <verse number="19" style="v"/>hanibenile pfighate pfila pfitano na kuweng'a wala iwanu elufu tano? Apfi tsamdondole pfiseghe pfingapi ipfimemile pfihande ipfisighale?”</para>
  <para style="p">Wamlongela, “Kumi na pfili.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v"/>“Na hanibenile pfighate pfila saba na kuweng'a iwanu elufu nne, apfi mdondole pfiseghe pfingapi ipfimemile pfihande ipfisighale?”</para>
  <para style="p">Wamwidika “Saba.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v"/>Kawaghutsa, “Pfii ng'ana mmanye bae?”</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu komuhonetsa ichifita ako Betisaida.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v"/>Tsawapfika Betisaida, iwanu wangi wamghalila Yesu ichifita, wamlomba amkinde. <verse number="23" style="v"/>Kamkinda ghumoko ichifita yula, kamlapfa kunze kwe chijiji. Kuya kambwalulila ghamate mnenge, kamwikila ghamoko ghake, kamghutsa, “Kwodaha kwona ichinu chochose?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v"/>Imunu ayo kalola kuya kalonga, “Nakwona iwanu, wakoneka ka imibiki itsunguluka.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v"/>Yesu keka keli ghamoko mne tsinenge tse imunu ayo. Kuya tsinenge tsake tsifughuka, naye kona pfinoghile ipfinu pfose. <verse number="26" style="v"/>Yesu kamlongela aghende ukaye yake na kamghoma kwingila mne ipfijiji na kuwalongela iwanu.</para>
  <para style="s">Petiri komtoghola Yesu kuwa Kiristu.</para>
  <para style="r">(Matei 16:13-20; Luka 9:18-21)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v"/>Yesu ne iwanang'ina wake waghenda mne ipfijiji pfa Kaisariya Filipi. Mnzila Yesu kawaghutsa, “Apfi iwanu wolonga nene nili nani?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v"/>Wamwidika, “Wangi wolonga ghweghwe kwa Yohane Mbatitsa, wangi wolonga kwa Eliya na wangi wolonga kwa yumwe wa manabii.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v"/>Kuya Yesu kawaghutsa, “Namwe mwolonga nene nili nani?” Petiri kamwidika “Ghweghwe kwa Kiristu.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v"/>Yesu kawakanya “Mleke kumlongela imunu wowose mbuli tsangu.”</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kolonga imbuli ya kudununzika na lifwa lyake.</para>
  <para style="r">(Matei 16:21-28; Luka 9:22-27)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v"/>Kuya kandusa kuwalangulitsa iwanang'ina wake. “Imwana we Imunu kobamighwa adununzike ng'ani na kulemighwa ne iwabala, watambika wakulu, ne iwolangulitsa Ghamalaghitso. Na kobamighwa akomighwe ne atsilihuke mne litsuwa lya kadatu.” <verse number="32" style="v"/>Tsakawalongela imbuli ayo bila kupfisa, apfo Petiri kamsola Yesu mmbalimbali, kandusa kumkembela. <verse number="33" style="v"/>Lekeni Yesu kahunduka, kawalolesa iwanang'ina wake na kumkembela Petiri, “Soghela hano Setani! Kwaapfila ng'aukwalangula bae mbuli tse Imulungu, ila kokwalangula mbuli tse iwanu.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v"/>Kuya Yesu kawakema iwanang'ina wake na kingili lye iwanu kawalongela, “Imunu wowose iyobama kuniwinza, yeleme imwenyegho, asole msalaba ghwake aniwinze.” <verse number="35" style="v"/>Kwaapfila imunu wowose iyobama kuukombola ughima wake, katsowaghisa, ila imunu wowose iyowaghisa ughima wake kwaajili ya nene na kwaajili ye Imbuli Inoghile katsoukombola. <verse number="36" style="v"/>Apfi iwanu wobweda choni ka wopata isi yose lekeni wakwaghisa ughima wawo? <verse number="37" style="v"/>Kuduhu ichinu chawodaha kulapfa waupate keli ughima wawo. <verse number="38" style="v"/>Imunu ang'ambonela chinyala nene na mbuli tsangu mne iwanu wa mweleko ghuno ghwa nzambi na utsinzi, Imwana we Imunu katsomwonela chinyala hatsakutsa mne utunitso wa Aba wake hamwe ne wamalaika wahenzeluka wa kulanga.</para>
  <chapter number="9" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Yesu koghaluka chihanga</para>
  <para style="r">(Matei 17:1-13; Luka 9:28-36)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Kaghendelela kulonga, “Nowalongela ghendo, iwanu wamwenga iwemile hano ng'awatsakufa bae mbaka wawone Undewa we Imulungu iukutsa kwe ingupfu.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v"/>Matsuwa sita hambele, Yesu kawasola Petiri, Jakobu na Yohane, kaghenda nawo mchidando hanu halihela imunu. Baho Yesu kaghaluka chihanga, hambele hawo. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Na ghamaghwanda ghake ghawa matselu ng'ani, kuduhu imunu wowose mne isi iyodaha kughatsapfa ghamaghwanda ghawe matselu apfo. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Kuya Eliya na Musa walawila hambele hawo, walonga na Yesu. <verse number="5" style="v"/>Petiri kamlongela Yesu, “Mlangulitsi, pfinogha twetwe tukale hano. Leka tutsenge pfibumbulika pfidatu, chimwe cha kwako, chimwe cha Musa na chimwe che Eliya.” <verse number="6" style="v"/>Ng'amanyile bae cha kulonga, kwaapfila wose tsawang'ali wopfuka ng'ani.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v"/>Kuya liwingu lilawila, liwaghubika, na litsi lilawila mne liwingu. “Ayuno imwanangu yanoghele, mumtegheletse!” <verse number="8" style="v"/>Bahala hawalolese mmbalimbali ng'awamwonile imunu wowose hamwe nawo, ila Yesu yaliyeka.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v"/>Hawakalile wohulumka kulawa mchidando, Yesu kawalaghitsa waleke kumlongela imunu wowose ghawonile, mbaka Imwana we Imunu hatsotsilihuka kulawa mne lifwa.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v"/>Watoghola chayalongile, lekeni weghutsa, “Kutsilihuka kulawa mne lifwa mana yake choni?” <verse number="11" style="v"/>Kuya wamghutsa Yesu, “Ebali iwolangulitsa Ghamalaghitso wolonga Eliya kobamighwa tanu yatse?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v"/>Yesu kawedika, “Ona, tanu Eliya kakutsa kwika chila ichinu pfinoghile. Ebali lelo yandikighwa Imwana we Imunu kobamighwa yadununzike na kulemighwa? <verse number="13" style="v"/>Lekeni nowalongela, Eliya katsa na wamtendela ghose ghawabamile, ka mbuli tsake pfatsandikighwe.”</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu komuhonetsa imsongolo yane ichinyamkela</para>
  <para style="r">(Matei 17:14-21; Luka 9:37-43a)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v"/>Hawawapfikile iwanang'ina wangi, wona mtingano mkulu we iwanu liwatsunguluka ne iwolangulitsa Ghamalaghitso wehisanya nawo. <verse number="15" style="v"/>Bahala iwanu wose hawamwonile Yesu wakangawala ng'ani, wamtsumila kumlamsa. <verse number="16" style="v"/>Yesu kawaghutsa iwanang'ina wake, “Apfi mwehisanya nawo choni?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v"/>Imunu yumwe mne kingili lye iwanu kamwidika, “Mlangulitsi, nikughalila imwanangu kana ichinyamkela iyamtedile awe chibubu. <verse number="18" style="v"/>Na chila hayomnighula, komghwisa hasi, na imwana kolawa lihofu mne mlomo, koghegheda ghamatsino ghake kuya koghoghodala. Niwalomba iwanang'ina wako wamlapfe ichinyamkela, lekeni ng'awadahile bae.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v"/>Yesu kawedika, “Mwemwe lukolo ing'alutoghola! Nikale namwe mbaka tsuwachi? Mnighalile imwana ayo!” <verse number="20" style="v"/>Wamghalila imwana ayo. Ichinyamkela hamwonile Yesu, bahala kamghwisa imwana ayo chisala, imwana kaghwa hasi na kwibulughitsa, kalapfa lihopfu mne mlomo. <verse number="21" style="v"/>Yesu kamghutsa aba we imwana ayo, “Angu imwana yuno kapfino kulawa tsuwachi?”</para>
  <para style="p">Kamwidika, “Kulawa udodo wake. <verse number="22" style="v"/>Komghwisagha mne ghumoto au mne ghamatsi ili yamkome. Lekeni ka kwodaha kutenda ichinu, utwonele libatsi ne utwapfile.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v"/>Yesu kalonga, “Ka kwodaha! Ghose ghodahika kwe imunu iyotoghola.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v"/>Bahala aba we imwana yula kakemelela kalonga, “Notoghola, ila unyapfile nitoghole ghendo!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v"/>Yesu halyonile kingili lye iwanu lyakongetseka hambele hake, kamkembela ichinyamkela ayo, “Ghwe ichinyamkela we ububu ne utsiwi, nokulongela ulawe mne imwana yuno na uleke kumwingila keli!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v"/>Ichinyamkela kakemelela, kamghwisa chisala imwana ayo, kamlawa. Na imwana tsakoneka ka kafa, na iwanu wengi walonga, “Kafa!” <verse number="27" style="v"/>Lekeni Yesu kamkinda ghumoko imwana ayo, kamwapfila kwinuka, naye kenuka.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v"/>Yesu hayengile mng'anda, iwanang'ina wake wamghutsa hawakalile naye waliyeka, “Ebali twetwe ng'atudahile bae kumlapfa ichinyamkela yula?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v"/>Yesu kawedika, “Ichinyamkela ka yuno ng'odaha bae kulawa kwa inzila yoyose, ila kwa kulomba kuliyeka.”</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kolonga keli imbuli ya ukufa kwake</para>
  <para style="r">(Matei 17:22-23; Luka 9:43b-45)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v"/>Yesu na iwanang'ina wake woka hanu hala waghenda Galilaya. Yesu ng'abamile bae imunu wowose amanye kwayali, <verse number="31" style="v"/>kwaapfila yang'ali yowalangulitsa iwanang'ina wake. Kawalongela, “Imwana we imunu katsoghelighwa mne ghamoko ghe iwanu, nawo watsomkoma. Ghamatsuwa madatu hambele, katsotsilihuka.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v"/>Lekeni ng'awaimanyile bae imbuli ayo na wapfuka kumghutsa.</para>
  <para style="s">Yuhi iyali mkulu?</para>
  <para style="r">(Matei 18:1-5; Luka 9:46-48)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v"/>Hawafikile Kaperinaumu, wengila mng'anda na Yesu kawaghutsa iwanang'ina wake, “Ichinu chachi chamng'ali mwisongela mnzila?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v"/>Lekeni ng'awamwidike bae, kwaapfila wang'ali wesongela yuhi yali mkulu.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v"/>Yesu kakala hasi, kawakema iwanang'ina wake kumi na weli, kalonga, “Imunu wowose yobama kuwa wa mwanduso, kobamighwa yawe wa utsighilo, na yawe imtumwa wa wose.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v"/>Kuya kamsola imwana mdodo, kamwika mghati mwawo, kawalongela, <verse number="37" style="v"/>“Imunu wowose iyombokela imwana mdodo ka yuno kwa taghwa lyangu, kombokela nene. Ne imunu iyombokela nene, kombokela yula iyanitumile.”</para>
  <para style="s">Imunu wowose iyotutoghola kaubali wetu</para>
  <para style="r">(Luka 9:49-50)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v"/>Yohane kamlongela Yesu, “Mlangulitsi, tumwona imunu kolapfa ipfinyamkela kwa taghwa lyako. Tumghoma kwaapfila ng'olawila bae mne kingili lyetu.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v"/>Yesu kawalongela, “Mleke kumghoma. Haduhu imunu iyodaha kutenda ipfinzonza kwa taghwa lyangu na baho kulonga mbuli tsangu pfihile. <verse number="40" style="v"/>Kwaapfila imunu wowose yali ubali wetu, ayo kamiyetu. <verse number="41" style="v"/>Nowalongela ghendo, imunu wowose iyoweng'a ichikombe cha ghamatsi kwaapfila mwemwe mwa iwanu wa Kiristu, katsobokela ghweko lyake.</para>
  <para style="s">Ukuhonza iwanu wangi</para>
  <para style="r">(Matei 18:6-9; Luka 17:1-2)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v"/>“Imunu wowose iyowahonza wadodo wano iwonitoghola watende ghehile, ng'apfu imunu ayo yohighwe libwe lya kusaghila msingo mwake na kwasighwa mne ibahali. <verse number="43" style="v"/>Ka ghumoko ghwako ghwokuhonza utende ghehile, ghughane. Ng'apfu kwingila kune ughima na ghumoko ghumwe, kubita kwingila jehanamu na ghamoko meli. <verse number="44" style="v"/>Ako membele iwowaja ng'awakufa bae, na ghumoto ighuwalakatsa ng'aghutsimika bae. <verse number="45" style="v"/>Ka mghulu ghwako wokuhonza utende ghehile, ghughane. Ng'apfu kwingila kune ughima na mghulu ghumwe, kubita kuwa na ghamaghulu meli na kwasighwa jehanamu. <verse number="46" style="v"/>Ako membele iwowaja ng'awakufa bae, na ghumoto ighuwalakatsa ng'aghutsimika bae. <verse number="47" style="v"/>Na ka inenge yako yokuhonza utende ghehile, ing'ole. Ng'apfu kwingila kune Undewa we Imulungu na inenge imwe, kubita kuwa na tsinenge mbili na kwasighwa jehanamu. <verse number="48" style="v"/>Ako membele wake ng'awakufa bae, na ghumoto ghwake ng'aghutsimika bae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v"/>“Chila imunu katsodeghetetsighwa kwa ghumoto ka inyama pfaighumighwa imunyu.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v"/>“Imunyu inogha, lekeni ka ihinyika, itsoghumighwa choni mbaka ikolele keli?</para>
  <para style="p">“Muwe ne imunyu mghati mwenu, na mkale tseghamba.”</para>
  <chapter number="10" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Yesu kolangulitsa imbuli ya talaka</para>
  <para style="r">(Matei 19:1-12; Luka 16:18)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Kuya Yesu koka hanu hala kaghenda kune chijiji cha Yudeya na kuloka ghumto Yoridani. Kuya kingili lye iwanu limtsila, naye kawalangulitsa ka pfatsowele.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v"/>Mafarisayo wangi wamghendela, wamghetsa kwa kumghutsa, “Apfi pfinogha imunu kumleka mwehe wake?” <verse number="3" style="v"/>Yesu kawedika, “Apfi Musa yalaghitse choni?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v"/>Wedika, “Musa kalonga, twodaha kwandika talaka na kuwaleka.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v"/>Yesu kawalongela, “Musa kandika apfo kwaapfila imimoyo yenu misughu. <verse number="6" style="v"/>Lekeni kulawa mwanduso, ‘Imulungu kalumba mmale ne ipinga.’ <verse number="7" style="v"/>‘Apfo, immale katsomleka mai wake na aba wake, naye katselunga na mwehe wake, <verse number="8" style="v"/>nawo watsokuwa lukuli lumwe na si weli keli bae, ila lukuli lumwe.’ <verse number="9" style="v"/>Apfo chayalungile Imulungu, imunu yaleke kuchibaghula.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v"/>Hawoyile keli mng'anda, iwanang'ina wake wamghutsa Yesu imbuli ayo. <verse number="11" style="v"/>Kawedika, “Imunu wowose iyomleka mwehe wake na kukwela ipinga yungi komtendela utsinzi mwehe wake. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Pfipfila, ipinga yomleka immale wake na kukwelighwa ne immale yungi komtendela utsinzi immale wake.” <verse number="13" style="v"/>Iwanu wamwenga wamghalila Yesu iwana wadowado yawekile ghamoko, lekeni iwanang'ina wake wawakembela. <verse number="14" style="v"/>Yesu honile apfi tsakona usungu, kawalongela, “Muwaleke iwana wadowado watse kuna nene, mleke kuwaghoma kwaapfila Undewa wa Imulungu wa iwana ka wano. <verse number="15" style="v"/>Nowalongela ghendo, imunu wowose yolema kuubokela Undewa we Imulungu ka imwana mdodo, ng'atsowingila bae.” <verse number="16" style="v"/>Kawasola iwana awo, kawekila ghamoko, kawabaliki.</para>
  <para style="s">Imunu tajiri</para>
  <para style="r">(Matei 19:16-30; Luka 18:18-30)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v"/>Yesu hayang'ali yakuka, imunu yumwe kamtsumila, kamtowela maghoti, kamghutsa. “Mlangulitsi yunoghile, nitende ichinu chachi niubokele ughima wa ghamatsuwa ghose?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v"/>Yesu kamghutsa, “Ebali unikema nene ninogha? Kuduhu imunu yanoghile ila Imulungu yaliyeka. <verse number="19" style="v"/>Kwoghamanya ghamalaghitso. ‘Uleke kukoma, Uleke utsinzi, Uleke ubapfi, Uleke kulonga ughutsu, Uleke ung'enye, Uwahulikitse aba wako na mai wako.’ ”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v"/>Imunu ayo kamwidika, “Mlangulitsi, agho ghose nighakinda kulawa udodo wangu.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v"/>Yesu kamlola, kamnoghela, kamlongela, “Kuhungukighwa na ichinu chimwe, ghenda ukautse pfose pfaulinapfo uweng'e sendi iwahingwa, naghwe kutsakuwa ne utajiri kulanga. Kuya utse uniwinze.” <verse number="22" style="v"/>Hayahulike apfo, kaghudubuka koka kwa usungu kwaapfila tsakakala na mali nyingi.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v"/>Yesu kalola mmbalimbali, kawalongela iwanang'ina wake, “Itsakuwa pfikomu kwe imunu tajiri kwingila mne Undewa we Imulungu.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v"/>Iwanang'ina wake wakangawala hawahulike mbuli atso. Lekeni Yesu kalonga keli, “Iwanangu, itsakuwa pfikomu kwingila mne Undewa wa Imulungu! <verse number="25" style="v"/>Pfikomu kwa imunu tajiri kwingila mne undewa wa Imulungu kubita imnyama yokemighwa ngamiya kwingila mne litobo lya sindano.”<figure style="fig" desc="" file="14 Camel.jpg" size="col" loc="" copy="" ref="10:25">Ngamiya</figure></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v"/>Iwanang'ina wakangawala ghendo, weghutsa, “Lelo yuhi iyodaha kukombolighwa?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v"/>Yesu kawalola, kalonga, “Kwe imunu ng'aidahika bae, lekeni kwe Imulungu si pfipfo bae, ghose ghodahika kwe Imulungu.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v"/>Petiri kamlongela, “Tuleka chila chinu tukuwinza ghweghwe!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v"/>Yesu kawedika, “Nowalongela ghendo, imunu wowose yalekile kaye yake au iwandughu tsake au lumbu tsake, aba wake au mai wake au iwanaghe au imighunda kwaajili ya nene ne Imbuli Inoghile, <verse number="30" style="v"/>katsobokela ketseketse mne ghamatsuwa ghano. Katsobokela kaye, iwandughu, lumbu, mai, iwana, ne imighunda na kudununzika na mne ghamatsuwa ighakutsa katsobokela ughima wa ghamatsuwa ghose. <verse number="31" style="v"/>Lekeni awala iwalongole watsakuwa kuchughu ne iwali kuchughu watsolongola.”</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kolonga lwakadatu imbuli ya lifwa lyake</para>
  <para style="r">(Matei 20:17-19; Luka 18:31-34)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v"/>Yesu ne iwanang'ina wake wang'ali wogheluka woghenda Yerusalemu, Yesu kawalongola, iwanang'ina wake wakangawala ne iwanu iwakalile womuwinza wose wapfuka. Yesu kawasola keli iwanang'ina wake kumi na weli mmbalimbali, kawalongela aghala ighatsomlawila. <verse number="33" style="v"/>Kawalongela, “Mtegheletse, twoghenda Yerusalemu, ako Imwana we Imunu katsakwing'ighwa kwa pfilongotsi we inambiko na iwolangulitsa Ghamalaghitso. Nawo watsomuhigha yafe na kwing'ighwa kwa Iwanu si Wayahudi bae. <verse number="34" style="v"/>Watsombetsa, watsombwalulila ghamate, watsomfapula ne ipfiboko, na ghamatsuwa madatu hambele, katsotsilihuka.”</para>
  <para style="s">Yakobu na Yohane womlomba Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(Matei 20:20-28)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v"/>Kuya Jakobu na Yohane, iwana wa Sebedayo wamghendela Yesu, wamlongela, “Mlangulitsi kuna ichinu twobama ututendele twetwe.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v"/>Kawaghutsa, “Chinu chachi?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v"/>Wamwidika, hautsokala mne chighoda chako che Undewa mne utunitso wako, twobama tukale naghwe, yumwe ubali wako wa kujilo na yungi ubali wako wa kumoso.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v"/>Yesu kawedika, “Ng'ammanyile bae chamlomba. Apfi mwodaha kunwela ichikombe chanikunwela nene au kubatitsighwa ubatitso wanibatitsighwa nene?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v"/>Wamwidika, “Twodaha.” Yesu kawalongela, “Mtsochinwela ichikombe chanikunwela nene na kubatitsighwa ubatitso wanibatitsighwa. <verse number="40" style="v"/>Lekeni imbuli ya kukala ubali wangu wa kujilo au wa kumoso si yangu bae kuweng'a. Hanu aho watsokala awala iwasaghulighwe ne Imulungu.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v"/>Iwanang'ina wala kumi hawahulike achila chawalombile Jakobu na Yohane wawonela maya. <verse number="42" style="v"/>Yesu kawakema wose hamwe, kawalongela, “Mwomanya awala iwakwoneka iwakulu we iwanu iwali si Wayahudi bae wowatawala kwe ingupfu. Na iwakulu awo wana ukulu kune iwanu. <verse number="43" style="v"/>Lekeni kuna mwemwe ileke kuwa apfo, imunu wowose iyobama kuwa mkulu kuna mwemwe kobamighwa yawe imtumwa, <verse number="44" style="v"/>imunu wowose iyobama kuwa mkulu kobamighwa yawe imtumwa wa wose. <verse number="45" style="v"/>Kwaapfila Imwana we Imunu, ng'atsile bae kutumikighwa, ila katsa kutumikila na kulapfa ughima wake kwa kuwakombola iwanu wengi.”</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu komuhonetsa ichifita Batimayo</para>
  <para style="r">(Matei 20:29-34; Luka 18:35-43)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v"/>Kuya wapfika Yeriko, Yesu ne iwanang'ina wake hamwe na kingili lye iwanu hawang'ali wakuka mne ghumji, ichifita yumwe iyakemighwe Batimayo imwana wa Timayo kakala mmbalimbali mwe inzila kolomba. <verse number="47" style="v"/>Naye hayahulike Yesu Mnatsareti kobita, kandusa kukemelela, “Yesu, Imwana wa Daudi! Mbonele libatsi.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v"/>Iwanu wengi wamkembela, wamlongela yenyamale, lekeni kaghendelela kukema, “Imwana wa Daudi, mbonele libatsi!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v"/>Yesu kema, kalonga, “Mlongeleni yatse.” Apfo wamkema, wamlongela, “Wighangamitse! Winuke kokukema.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v"/>Kalyasa lighwanda lyake, kadaluka kamghendela Yesu.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v"/>Yesu kamghutsa, “Kwobama nikutendele choni?”</para>
  <para style="p">Ichifita ayo kamwidika, “Mlangulitsi, nobama kwona.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v"/>Yesu kamlongela, “Ghenda, ukutoghola kwako kukuhonetsa.”</para>
  <para style="p">Bahala kadaha kwona, kuya kamuwinza Yesu mnzila.</para>
  <chapter number="11" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Yesu kakwingila Yerusalemu kwa ndeng'elo</para>
  <para style="r">(Matei 21:1-11; Luka 19:28-40; Yohane 12:12-19)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Hawapfikile habehi na Yerusalemu, habehi ne imiji ya Betifage na Betaniya, kune Chidunda cha Mitseituni, Yesu kawatuma iwanang'ina wake weli walongole. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Kawalongela, “Mghende mne ichijiji ichili hambele henu, hamtsokwingila, mtsomwona imwana we ipunda kohighwa, naye yang'ali kudinighwa ne imunu. Mumdohole, mumghale hano. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Imunu wowose ang'awaghutsa, ‘Ebali mtenda apfo?’ mumlongele, ‘Imtwatsa kombama, kuya katsomuyitsa sambi.’ ”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v"/>Iwanang'ina wala woka, wamwona imwana we ipunda kohighwa hane libani. Hawang'ali womdohola, <verse number="5" style="v"/>iwanu wangi iwemile hala wawaghutsa, “Mtenda choni? Mwomdohola imwana we ipunda?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v"/>Wawedika ka Yesu pfayawalongele ne iwanu awo wawaleka woke naye. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Wamghala imwana we ipunda ayo kwa Yesu, kuya weka ghamaghwanda ghawo mchanya mwake, Yesu kakala mchanya mwake. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Iwanu wengi wanzasa ghamaghwanda ghawo mnzila, ne iwanu wangi wabena imiputila mne imighunda, wainzasa mnzila. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Ne iwanu iwamlongolele na awala iwamuwinzile wakemelela walonga, “Mumtunitse Imulungu! Yabalikiighwe iyakutsa kwa taghwa lye Imtwatsa! <verse number="10" style="v"/>Imulungu ubaliki Undewa iukutsa wa mndewa wetu Daudi. Mumtunye Imulungu yali kuchanya ng'ani!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v"/>Yesu kengila Yerusalemu, kaghenda mne Ing'anda ye Imulungu. Kalola mmbalimbali chila hanu, lekeni kwaapfila litsua tsaliswa, kaghenda Betaniya ne iwanang'ina wake kumi na weli.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu koghulighita ghumbiki ghwa mtini</para>
  <para style="r">(Matei 21:18-19)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v"/>Nemitondo yake hawang'ali wolawa Betaniya, Yesu tsakakala na nzala. <verse number="13" style="v"/>Kaghwona ghumbiki ghwa mtini kwa kutali ghune imitsani mingi. Kaghenda kulola ka kodaha kupata tini. Lekeni hayapfikile ng'apatile bae tini ila imitsani iliyeka, kwaapfila msimu wa tini tsaghung'ali. <verse number="14" style="v"/>Kuya Yesu kaghulongela ghumbiki, “Kulawa lelo na kughendelela, kuduhu imunu iyatsokuja keli ghamatunda ghako.” Ne iwanang'ina wake wamuhulika hayalongile apfo.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu koghenda mne Ing'anda ye Imulungu</para>
  <para style="r">(Matei 21:12-17; Luka 19:45-48; Yohane 2:13-22)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v"/>Hawapfikile Yerusalemu, Yesu kengila mne Ing'anda ye Imulungu, kandusa kuwawinga awala iwang'ali wohutsa na kughula mghati mwe Ing'anda ye Imulungu. Katsibidula tsimetsa tse iwanu iwotsibena tsisendi na pfighoda pfe iwanu iwohutsa iwanjiwa, <verse number="16" style="v"/>kawaghoma kusola ichinu chochose mghati mwe Ing'anda ye Imulungu. <verse number="17" style="v"/>Kuya kawalangulitsa, “Apfi ng'ayandikighwe bae,</para>
  <para style="q">‘Ing'anda yangu itsokemighwa</para>
  <para style="q">ing'anda ya ukulombela ye iwanu we isi tsose?’</para>
  <para style="q">Lekeni mwemwe mwoitenda mango ye iwabapfi!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v"/>Wapfilongotsi we inambiko na iwolangulitsa Ghamalaghitso hawahulike apfi, wandusa kubama inzila ya kumkoma Yesu. Lekeni wang'ali wompfuka, kwaapfila iwanu wose wang'ali wokangawala kwa ghamalangulitso ghake.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v"/>Mihe haipfikile, Yesu ne iwanang'ina wake woka mne ghumji agho.</para>
  <para style="s">Ghamalaghitso ghe ghumtini ghunyalile</para>
  <para style="r">(Matei 21:20-22)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v"/>Nemitondo yake, hawang'ali woghenda waghwona ghumtini ghula ghunyala kulawa msina. <verse number="21" style="v"/>Petiri kakumbuka chayalongile Yesu, kamlongela, “Mlangulitsi, ulole! Imbiki ghughulighite ghunyala!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v"/>Yesu kedika, “Mumtoghole Imulungu. <verse number="23" style="v"/>Nowalongela ghendo, imunu wowose ang'achilongela chidunda chino, ‘Ghenda wiyase mwibahali’ na ka ng'akwalangula mne ghumoyo ghwake na kutoghola chayalongile chitsolawila, chitsotendeka kwaajili yake. <verse number="24" style="v"/>Apfo nowalongela, hamlomba na kulomba ghoghose, mtoghole ka mwoghabokela, nagho ghatsokuwa ghenu. <verse number="25" style="v"/>Na hamlomba, ka kuna imunu kakutendela pfihile, umleghusile ghamatotso ghake, naye Aba wenu yali kulanga katsowaleghusila nzambi tsenu.” <verse number="26" style="v"/>Lekeni ka ng'amuwaleghusila ghamatotso ghawo, naye Aba wenu yali kulanga ng'atsowaleghusila nzambi tsenu bae.</para>
  <para style="s">Imbuli ye ukulu wa Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(Matei 21:23-27; Luka 20:1-8)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v"/>Wapfika keli Yerusalemu, na Yesu hayang'ali koghenda ghenda mne Ing'anda ye Imulungu, pfilongotsi we inambiko, iwolangulitsa Ghamalaghitso ne iwabala wamghendela. <verse number="28" style="v"/>Wamghutsa, “Kwa ukulu wachi kotenda ipfinu pfino? Na yuhi iyakwing'ile ukulu uno wa kutenda ghano?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v"/>Yesu kawedika, “Na nene nowaghutsa imbuli imwe, mnyidike, nani nitsowalongela kwa ukulu wachi notenda ghano ghose. <verse number="30" style="v"/>Mnilongele, ubatitso wa Yohane ulawa kulanga au kwe iwanu?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v"/>Weghutsa, walonga, “Tung'alonga ‘Ulawa kulanga’ katsotughutsa, ‘Ebali lelo ng'amtoghole?’ <verse number="32" style="v"/>lekeni tung'alonga, ‘Ulawa kwe iwanu.’ ” Wawapfuka iwanu, kwaapfila iwanu wose tsawamanya Yohane tsakakala nabii. <verse number="33" style="v"/>Apfo wamwidika, “Ng'atumanyile bae.”</para>
  <para style="p">Yesu kawalongela, “Na nene siwalongela bae yuhi iyangaile ukulu wa kutenda ghano.”</para>
  <chapter number="12" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Imbuli ye iwakulima na mghunda ghwa mitsabibu</para>
  <para style="r">(Matei 21:33-46; Luka 20:9-19)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Yesu kandusa kulonga nawo kwa imbuli, “Imunu yumwe tsakahanda mitsabibu mne mghunda. Kuya kaghutsengela luwa, kahimba hanu ha ukukamila na kutsenga chilingilo. Keka wemilitsi, kuya koka isi ya kutali.<figure style="fig" desc="" file="04 Winepress.jpg" size="col" loc="" copy="" ref="12:1">4. Iwanu weli wokama tsabibu mne chinu cho ukukamila dipfai</figure> <verse number="2" style="v"/>Ghumsimu ghwa kupfuna tsabibu haghupfikile, kamtuma imtumwa wake akasole tsabibu. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Lekeni wemilitsi wamghogha, wamtowa, wamuwinga bila kumwing'a chinu. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Kuya imunu ayo kamtuma imtumwa yungi. Ayo wamtowa mwitwi na kumtendela pfihile. <verse number="5" style="v"/>Kamtuma yungi, ayo naye wamkoma. Kawatuma iwatumwa wangi wengi, wangi wawatowa na wangi wawakoma. <verse number="6" style="v"/>Yakalile imunu yumwe yaliheka wa kumtuma, naye iye imwanaghe iyamnoghele ng'ani. Kalonga, ‘Ayu wa ukumambulitsa nakwona watsomhulikitsa, kwaapfila ka mwanangu.’ <verse number="7" style="v"/>Lekeni wemilitsi wala welongela, ‘Ayu ambe mhala mghunda ghuno. Leka tumkome ili mghunda ghuno ghuwe ghwetu!’ <verse number="8" style="v"/>Wamghogha, wamkoma, wamwasa kunze kwe mghunda.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v"/>Yesu kaghutsa, “Imunu yane mghunda yatsotendatse? Katsakutsa kuwakoma wemilitsi wose na kuweng'a iwanu wangi mghunda aghwo. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Ng'amsomile bae liandiko ililonga.</para>
  <para style="q">‘Libwe lyawalilemile iwotsenga,</para>
  <para style="q">Alyo liwa libwe kulu lya haghati.</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v"/>Imbuli ino ilawa kwe Imtwatsa,</para>
  <para style="q">nayo yotukangawatsa!’ ”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v"/>Tsawabama kumghogha kwaapfila tsawamanya ka imbuli yailongile kawalonga wawo, ila wawapfuka iwanu. Apfo wamleka yaliyeka, woka.</para>
  <para style="s">Imbuli ye ukuliha kodi</para>
  <para style="r">(Matei 22:15-22; Luka 20:20-26)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v"/>Hambele, wawatuma Mafarisayo wangi ne iwanu wa kingili lya Herodi kuna Yesu ili wamteghe ghayolonga. <verse number="14" style="v"/>Wamghendela, walonga, “Imlangulitsi, twokumanya ghweghwe kwa imunu yulongesa ghendo, na ng'aupfuka bae ukulu we imunu, wala ng'aulola ipfihanga pfe iwanu. Lekeni kwoilangulitsa ghendo inzila ye Imulungu. Utulongele, apfi pfinogha au ng'apfinoghile bae kuliha kodi kwa Kaisari? Tumlihe au tuleke kumliha?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v"/>Lekeni Yesu kamanya ung'enye wawo. Kawaghutsa, “Ule mwobama kunitegha? Ngalileni sendi ayo niyone.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v"/>Wamghalila sendi ayo. Naye kawaghutsa, “Angu ichihanga chino na taghwa lino lya nani?”</para>
  <para style="p">Wamwidika, “Pfa Kaisari.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v"/>Kuya Yesu kawalongela, “Mmwing'e Kaisari pfa Kaisari na mmwing'e Imulungu pfe Imulungu.”</para>
  <para style="s">Imbuli ya ukutsilihuka kulawa mne lifwa.</para>
  <para style="r">(Matei 22:23-33; Luka 20:27-40)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v"/>Kuya Masadukayo, iwanu iwolonga kuduhu ukutsilihuka kulawa mne lifwa wamghendela Yesu wamghutsa, <verse number="19" style="v"/>“Mlangulitsi, Musa tsakatwandikila pfino, ka imunu indughu yake kafa, naye kamleka mwehe iyalihela iwana, ndughu we imunu ayo kobamighwa amkwele chitsuka ayo ili amwelekele ndughu yake iwana. <verse number="20" style="v"/>Tsakukala ne iwandughu saba. Imkulu wawo kakwela, naye kafa bila kuleka imwana wowose. <verse number="21" style="v"/>Ndughu wa keli kamkwela chitsuka ayo, naye kafa bila kweleka imwana. Ilawila pfipfo kwa ndughu wa kadatu. <verse number="22" style="v"/>Iwandughu wose saba wafa na ng'awalekile imwana bae. Kuya mwehe yula naye kafa. <verse number="23" style="v"/>Lelo iwanu hawatsotsilihuka kulawa mne lifwa, angu mwehe ayo yakuwa wa nani kwaapfila wose saba tsawamkwela?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v"/>Yesu kawedika, “Mwemwe mwakwagha kwaapfila ng'ammanya bae Ghamaandiko Mahenzeluka wala ngupfu ye Imulungu. <verse number="25" style="v"/>Iwanu iwafile hawatsotsilihuka, ng'awatsokwela wala kukwelighwa bae, watsakuwa ka wamalaika wa kulanga. <verse number="26" style="v"/>Kwe imbuli ya ukutsilihuka kwe iwanu iwafile, apfi ng'amsomile bae imbuli ya libagho ilikwaka mne ichitabu cha Musa, Imulungu pfayalongile na Abrahamu, ‘Nene na Imulungu wa Abrahamu, na Imulungu we Isaka na Imulungu wa Yakobu.’ <verse number="27" style="v"/>Yeye si Imulungu we iwanu iwafile bae, ila we iwanu waghima. Apfo mwagha ghendo!”</para>
  <para style="s">Laghitso kulu</para>
  <para style="r">(Matei 22:34-40; Luka 10:25-28)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v"/>Imlangulitsi yumwe wa ghamalaghitso katsa kawahulika wodawala. Hayonile Yesu kawedika ghoya kamghutsa, “Mne ghamalaghitso ghose, lihi laghitso kulu kubita ghose?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v"/>Yesu kedika, “Laghitso kulu alino. ‘Mtegheletse mwemwe Waisiraeli! Imtwatsa Imulungu wetu ka Imtwatsa yumwe yaliyeka. <verse number="30" style="v"/>Mnoghele Imulungu wako kwa ghumoyo ghwako ghwose na kwa muhe wako wose na kwa tsimbutsi tsako tsose na kwa ngupfu tsako tsose.’ <verse number="31" style="v"/>Na laghitso lya keli, ‘Mnoghele imunu wa habehi yako, ka pfawinoghela imwenyegho.’ Kuduhu laghitso kulu kubita agha meli.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v"/>Imlangulitsi ayo wa ghamalaghitso kamlongela Yesu, “Mlangulitsi, kwidika ghoya. Kulongesa ghendo, Imulungu ka yumwe na kuduhu imulungu yungi ila yeye. <verse number="33" style="v"/>Na kumnoghela Imulungu kwa ghumoyo ghwako ghwose na kwa tsimbutsi tsako tsose na kwa ngupfu tsako tsose, na kumnoghela imunu wa habehi yako ka pfawinoghela ghwe imwenyegho pfinogha ghendo kubita kumlapfila Imulungu inambiko.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v"/>Yesu hayonile kedika kwa ihekima, kamlongela, “Ng'uli kutali bae na Undewa we Imulungu.”</para>
  <para style="p">Kulawa baho, kuduhu imunu iyaghetsile kumghutsa Yesu imbuli yoyose.</para>
  <para style="s">Imbuli ya Kiristu</para>
  <para style="r">(Matei 22:41-46; Luka 20:41-44)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v"/>Yesu hayang'ali yolangulitsa mne ing'anda ye Imulungu, kawaghutsa, “Ebali iwolangulitsa Ghamalaghitso wolonga Kiristu kaimwana wa Daudi? <verse number="36" style="v"/>Ghumuhe Mwenzeluka tsakamlongotsa Daudi, naye kalonga,</para>
  <para style="q">‘Imtwatsa kamlongela Imtwatsa wangu,</para>
  <para style="q">Ukale ghumoko ghwangu ghwa kujilo</para>
  <para style="q">mbaka niweke iwehile wako</para>
  <para style="q">hasi ha ghamaghulu ghako.’</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v"/>“Daudi imwenyegho tsakamkema ‘Imtwatsa.’ Apfi Kiristu yodahatse kuwa imwanaghe?”</para>
  <para style="p">Iwanu wengi wamhulikitsa kwa kudeng'elela.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kowalongela iwanu walangitse na iwolangulitsa Ghamalaghitso</para>
  <para style="r">(Matei 23:1-36; Luka 20:45-47)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v"/>Yesu hayang'ali yolangulitsa kalonga, “Mwalangitse na iwolangulitsa Ghamalaghitso. Wonoghela kupfala ghamaghwanda matali na kulamsighwa mmasoko. <verse number="39" style="v"/>Na wosaghula ipfighoda ipfili hambele mne tsing'anda tsa ukulombela na kukala hanu hanoghile mne ipfihungo. <verse number="40" style="v"/>Wakuja mne tsing'anda tse pfitsuka, kwa kwilangusa wanogha, wolomba bila kwipfa. Awo watsohighighwa ng'ani.”</para>
  <para style="s">Sadaka ya chitsuka</para>
  <para style="r">(Luka 21:1-4)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v"/>Yesu tsakakala habehi na chinu cha kwikila sadaka, kalola iwanu pfawoghela tsisendi. Matajiri wengi walapfa sendi nyingi. <verse number="42" style="v"/>Kuya katsa chitsuka yumwe mhingwa kaghela sendi mbili. <verse number="43" style="v"/>Yesu kawakema iwanang'ina wake kalonga, “Nowalongela ghendo, chitsuka yuno keka nyingi kubita wose. <verse number="44" style="v"/>Wose walapfa tsimali tsawo itsiswelele, lekeni chitsuka yuno kalapfa pfose pfalinapfo.”</para>
  <chapter number="13" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Yesu kolonga imbuli ya kuhinyighwa kwe ing'anda ye Imulungu</para>
  <para style="r">(Matei 24:1-2; Luka 21:5-6)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Yesu hayang'ali yolawa kunze kwe ing'anda ye Imulungu, yumwe wa imwanang'ina wake kamlongela, “Mlangulitsi, ulole ghamabwe na tsing'anda pfatsinoghile!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v"/>Yesu kamwidika, “Apfi kwotsona tsing'anda tsino ng'ulu? Ng'alitsolekighwa libwe mchanya mwe libwe lingi, chila limwe litsakwasighwa hasi.”</para>
  <para style="s">Kughaya na kudununzika</para>
  <para style="r">(Matei 24:3-14; Luka 21:7-19)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v"/>Yesu tsakakala mchidando mwa Chidunda cha Mitseituni, kumwambu kwe ing'anda ye Imulungu. Petiri, Jakobu, Yohane ne Andereya wamghutsa hawakalile waliyeka. <verse number="4" style="v"/>“Utulongele, agha ghose ghatsolawila tsuwachi? Na kutsakuwa na chitango chachi agha ghose haghatsolawila?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v"/>Yesu kawalongela, “Mwalangitse, imunu aleke kuwaghutsukila. <verse number="6" style="v"/>Iwanu wengi watsakutsa kwa taghwa lyangu, watsolonga, ‘Nene nayeye!’ na watsowaghutsukila iwanu wengi. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Namwe hamtsohulika ng'ondo na mbuli tsa ng'ondo, mleke kupfuka. Ipfinu apfo pfobamighwa pfilawile, ila utsighilo ung'ali kutsa. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Iwanu we isi watsetowa ne iwanu wa isi ingi, undewa utsetowa ne undewa ungi, ne isi itsoking'isika chila hanu, na kutsolawila nzala ng'ulu. Agha ghose ghatsakuwa ka mwanduso wa usungu we kweleka.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v"/>“Namwe mwalangitse! Mtsoghoghighwa na kughalighwa mne libaratsa. Mtsotowighwa mne tsing'anda tsa ukulombela. Mtsakwima hambele he iwabala na iwandewa kwaajili yangu kuwalongela mbuli tsinoghile. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Na Imbuli Inoghile ye Imulungu yobamighwa kupetighwa mne tsiisi tsose. <verse number="11" style="v"/>Hawatsowaghogha na kuwaghala kune libaratsa, mleke ukwalangula cha ukulonga. Mlonge chochose chila chamtsakwing'ighwa, kwaapfila si mwemwe bae yamlonga, ila Ghumuhe Mwenzeluka. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Ndughu katsomlapfa ndughu yake yakomighwe, na aba katsomlapfa imwanaghe yakomighwe. Iwana watsowalema na kuwakoma aba na mai tsawo. <verse number="13" style="v"/>Iwanu wose watsowahila kwa taghwa lyangu, ila ayula yoghendelela mbaka usighilo katsokombolighwa.</para>
  <para style="s">Ghamaghayo makulu</para>
  <para style="r">(Matei 24:15-28; Luka 21:20-24)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v"/>“Hamtsakwona lideso lima hanu hang'alibamighwa kwima bae. (Imunu iyosoma amanye) Awala iwali mne isi ya Yudeya watsumile mpfidunda. <verse number="15" style="v"/>Imunu wowose iyali mkano aleke kuhulumka hasi, au kwingila mng'anda kulapfa ichinu chochose kunze. <verse number="16" style="v"/>Na yula iyali kumghunda aleke kuya ukaye kusola ghamaghwanda ghake. <verse number="17" style="v"/>Watsoghaya ng'ani iwapinga wane tsiinda ne iwapinga iwakong'etsa mne ghamatsuwa agho! <verse number="18" style="v"/>Mlombe agho ghaleke kulawila msimu wa chipfeghetsi! <verse number="19" style="v"/>Kwaapfila ghamatsuwa agho kutsakuwa na maghayo ighang'ali ghalawile kulawa mwanduso, Imulungu hayalumbile isi yose, mbaka sambi, na ng'aghatsolawila keli! <verse number="20" style="v"/>Na ka Imtwatsa ng'ahungutse bae ghamatsuwa agho, kuduhu imunu ang'adahile kukombolighwa. Lekeni kwaajili ye iwanu wake iyawasaghule, kahungutsa ghamatsuwa agho.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v"/>“Mne ghamatsuwa agho, imunu wowose ang'awalongela, ‘Lola, Kiristu kahano!’ au ‘Kakula!’ Mleke kumtoghola. <verse number="22" style="v"/>Kwaapfila watsolawila tsina Kiristu wa ughutsu na manabii wa ughutsu. Watsotenda ipfinzonza ne ipfitango na kuwaghutsukila hata wala iwasaghulighwe ne Imulungu, ka yodahika. <verse number="23" style="v"/>Mwalangitse! Niwalongela chila ichinu ichitsolawila.</para>
  <para style="s">Ukutsa kwe Imwana we Imunu</para>
  <para style="r">(Matei 24:29-31; Luka 21:25-28)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v"/>“Lekeni mna ghamatsuwa agho ahala maghayo aghatsomala, litsua litsakuwa ne ichisi, lwetsi ng'alutsolapfa ghumwanga bae, <verse number="25" style="v"/>tsinondo tsitsolaghala kulawa mlanga, na ngupfu tsa kulanga tsitsohighitsighwa. <verse number="26" style="v"/>Baho iwanu watsomwona Imwana we Imunu kakutsa mne ghamawingu kwe ingupfu ng'ulu na utunitso. <verse number="27" style="v"/>Naye katsowatuma wamalaika wake kuwasola awala iyawasaghule mne isi yose, kulawa ubali umwe mbaka ubali ungi!</para>
  <para style="s">Ghamalangulitso gha mtini</para>
  <para style="r">(Matei 24:32-35; Luka 21:29-33)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v"/>“Mwilangulitse imbuli ino kulawa mne mbiki ghwa mtini. Ghamaputila ghake haghakuwa madeke na kwandusa kutula, mwomanya chihangatsi cha habehi. <verse number="29" style="v"/>Pfipfila hamtsakona agha ghose gholawila, mmanye Imwana we Imunu kahabehi ghendo. <verse number="30" style="v"/>Nowalongela ghendo, iwanu wa mweleko ghuno ng'awatsoluta bae mbaka agha ghose ghalawile. <verse number="31" style="v"/>Kulanga ne isi pfitsoluta, ila mbuli tsangu ng'atsitsoluta bae.</para>
  <para style="s">Kuduhu iyomanya litsuwa wala saa</para>
  <para style="r">(Matei 24:36-44)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v"/>“Kuduhu iyomanya litsuwa lila wala saa ila. Hata wamalaika wa kulanga wala Imwana ng'awomanya, ila Imulungu yaliyeka iyomanya. <verse number="33" style="v"/>Mwalangitse, mkale meso kwaapfila ng'ammanya bae itskughwa tsuwachi. <verse number="34" style="v"/>Yeghala ne imunu yokile na kuwaleka iwatumwa wake, chila yumwe ne isang'ano yake. Kuya kamlaghitsa imkalitsi wa libani akale meso. <verse number="35" style="v"/>Apfo mkale meso, kwaapfila ng'ammanya bae yane ing'anda yatsakuya tsuwachi, kakuya nemihe, nechilo, ijogholo hayatsakwika, au nemitondotondo. <verse number="36" style="v"/>Ka kakuya kwa kwidukitsa, aleke kuwapfika muwasa. <verse number="37" style="v"/>Achino chaniwalongela, niwalongela iwanu wose. ‘Mwalangitse!’ ”</para>
  <chapter number="14" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Yuda kobama inzila ya kumhunduka Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(Matei 2:1-5; Luka 22:1-2; Yohane 11:45-53)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Tsaghakalile matsuwa meli ng'ana ichihungo che Ipasaka na pfighate ipfilihela hamila chipfike. Iwakulu we inambiko na iwolangulitsa Ghamalaghitso wabama inzila ya kumghogha Yesu chinyelenyele na kumkoma. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Walonga, “Tuleke kumghogha mne ichihungo che Ipasaka, hela iwanu watsotenda tsogho.”</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kobakighwa ghamafuta ne ipinga</para>
  <para style="r">(Matei 26:6-13; Yohane 12:1-8)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v"/>Yesu tsakakala Betaniya mng'anda mwa Simoni, imunu iyang'ali yoghula ukoma. Hawakalile mmetsa wakuja ichijo cha nemihe, ipinga yumwe iyaghalile ichupa ya ghamafuta ighonung'ila gha bei ng'ulu katsa. Kaipfughula na kamwitila Yesu mwitwi. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Iwanu iwakalile aho tsawona maya, welongela, “Ule kakwaghitsa ghamafuta gha bei ng'ulu? <verse number="5" style="v"/>Ghamafuta ghano ghang'autsighwe kwa bei ng'ulu na sendi weng'ighwe iwahingwa!” Kuya wamkembela ipinga ayo.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v"/>Yesu kalonga, “Mlekeni! Ule mumdesa? Yeye kanitendela ichinu chinoghile. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Iwahingwa mwinawo ghamatsuwa ghose, na mwodaha kuwapfila pfopfose pfambama. Lekeni ng'amtsakuwa na nene bae ghamatsuwa ghose. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Ipinga ayu katenda achila chayadahile. Kalongola kulubaka lukuli lwangu, lukale ghoya kwa kutsikighwa. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Nowalongela ghendo, hanu hohose imbuli inoghile haitsopetighwa mne isi, chayatendile ipinga ayu chitsolongighwa kwa kumkumbuka yeye.”</para>
  <para style="s">Yuda kotoghola kumhunduka Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(Matei 26:14-16; Luka 22:3-6)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v"/>Yuda Isikarioti, yumwe wa wala iwanang'ina kumi na weli, kaghenda kwe ipfilongotsi we inambiko ili amhunduke Yesu kuna wawo. <verse number="11" style="v"/>Nawo hawahulike wadeng'elela kwa achila chayalongile, wamlongela watsomwing'a sendi. Apfo kabama nzila ya ukumhunduka Yesu.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kakuja ichijo che Ipasaka ne iwanang'ina wake</para>
  <para style="r">(Matei 26:17-25; Luka 22:7-23; Yohane 13:21-30)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v"/>Mne litsuwa lya mwanduso lye Ichihungo cha Pfighate ipfilihela hamila na litsuwa lya kumkoma imwana we ing'olo we Ipasaka, iwanang'ina wake wamghutsa, “Apfi ubama tughende kwani tukakwikile ichijo cha Ipasaka?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v"/>Yesu kawatuma iwanang'ina wake weli, kawalongela, “Mghende kune ghumji, mtsetingana ne imunu iyaghalile chiya cha ghamatsi. Mmuwinze <verse number="14" style="v"/>mbaka kune ing'anda iyatsakwingila, kuya mumlongele imunu yane ing'anda, Imlangulitsi koghutsa, ‘Chilikwani chiheleto cha iwahenza, ili ndiye Ipasaka ne iwanang'ina wangu?’ <verse number="15" style="v"/>Kuya katsowalangusa chiheleto chikulu cha uchanya ichikighwe ghoya. Mtwikile amo.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v"/>Iwanang'ina tsawoka, waghenda kune ghumji, kuya tsawona ka Yesu pfawalongele. Apfo wachitenga ichijo che Ipasaka.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v"/>Kuya haipfikile nemihe, Yesu kapfika ne iwanang'ina wake kumi na weli. <verse number="18" style="v"/>Bahala hawang'ali wakuja mmetsa, Yesu kalonga, “Nowalongela ghendo, imunu yumwe kulawa kuna mwemwe iyakuja na nene, katsonihunduka.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v"/>Iwanang'ina waghanzika, chila yumwe kamghutsa, “Angu nene?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v"/>Yesu kawedika, “Yumwe kulawa mna mwemwe kumi na weli, iyopfabika chighate chake mne bakuli na nene. <verse number="21" style="v"/>Imwana we Imunu katsakufa ka pfayandikighwe. Lekeni katsoghaya imunu yula yomhunduka Imwana we Imunu. Ing'awile ng'apfu kwa imunu yula ka ng'elekighwe bae!”</para>
  <para style="s">Ichijo che Imtwatsa</para>
  <para style="r">(Matei 26:26-30; Luka 22:14-20; 1 Wakolinto 11:23-25)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v"/>Hawang'ali wakuja, Yesu kasola chighate, kachibaliki, kachimegha, kaweng'a iwanang'ina wake kawalongela, “Msole, aluno lukuli lwangu.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v"/>Kuya kasola chikombe, kachibaliki, kaweng'a, wose wachinwela.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v"/>Kawalongela, “Aino idamu yangu ya lilaghano iikwitika kwaajili ye iwanu wengi. <verse number="25" style="v"/>Nowalongela ghendo, sitsakunwa keli bae dipfai ya mitsabibu mbaka litsuwa lila lyanitsakunwa ingi mne Undewa we Imulungu.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v"/>Hawamalitse kwimba wila, waghenda kune Chidunda cha Mitseituni.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kotabili Petiri katsomhunduka</para>
  <para style="r">(Matei 26:26-30; Luka 22:14-20; 1 Wakolinto 11:23-25)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v"/>Yesu kawalongela, “Mwemwe wose mtsotsuma na kundeka, ka pfayandikighwe, ‘Nitsomtowa mdimi, ne iwang'olo watsopwililika.’ <verse number="28" style="v"/>Lekeni hanitsotsilihuka kulawa mne lifwa, nitsowalongola Galilaya.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v"/>Petiri kamlongela, “Hata wose wang'akuleka, nene sikuleka bae!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v"/>Lekeni Yesu kamwidika, “Nokulongela ghendo, leloli nechilo, ijogholo ng'ana yeke lwa keli, kutsonibela mala ndatu.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v"/>Lekeni Petiri kaghendelela kulonga, “Hata ka nobamighwa nife naghwe, mbe, sikubela bae!”</para>
  <para style="p">Ne iwanang'ina wangi wose walonga pfipfo.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kolomba mne ibostani ya Getisemane</para>
  <para style="r">(Matei 26:36-46; Luka 22:39-46)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v"/>Tsawapfika hanu hokemighwa Getisemane, Yesu kawalongela iwanang'ina wake, “Hanighenda kulomba, mwemwe mkale hano.” <verse number="33" style="v"/>Kawasola Petiri, Jakobu na Yohane, naye kandusa kughanzika na kwona usungu ng'ani mne ghumoyo ghwake. <verse number="34" style="v"/>Kawalongela, “Usungu uli mne ghumoyo ghwangu mkulu ng'ani, wodaha kunikoma. Mkale hano na mkale meso.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v"/>Kaghenda hambele chidogho, keghwisa hasi, kalomba, ka yodahika aleke kubitila mne ichipindi chila cha kudununzika. <verse number="36" style="v"/>Kalomba, “Aba wangu, ipfinu pfose pfodahika kuna ghweghwe. Uchilapfe chikombe cha kudununzika kuna nene, lekeni si ka pfanibama nene bae, ila pfaubama ghweghwe.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v"/>Kuya koya keli kawapfika iwanang'ina wake wadatu wawasa. Naye kamlongela Petiri, “Simoni, kuwasa? Ng'udahile bae kukala meso hata kwa saa imwe?” <verse number="38" style="v"/>Kuya kawalongela iwanang'ina wose, “Mkale meso, mlombe mleke kughetsighwa na ghehile. Ghumoyo ghwobama kutenda ghanoghile, lekeni lukuli lwahela ingupfu.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v"/>Kaghenda keli kulomba akuno kolonga ghaghala. <verse number="40" style="v"/>Kuya koya keli kawapfika iwanang'ina wake wawasa, ng'awadahile bae kufumbula tsinenge tsawo. Nawo ng'awamanyile bae chakumlongela Yesu.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v"/>Hayoile lwakadatu, kawalongela, “Mng'ali mwowasa na kubwihila? Lamkeni lelo! Ichipindi chipfika, Imwana we Imunu sambi kakwing'ighwa mne ghamoko ghe iwanu wane nzambi. <verse number="42" style="v"/>Mwinuke! Tughende! Mlole, ayuno hano imunu yonihunduka nene!”</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu koghoghighwa</para>
  <para style="r">(Matei 26:47-56; Luka 22:47-53; Yohane 18:3-12)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v"/>Yesu hayang'ali yolonga, Yuda, yumwe we iwanang'ina wake kumi na weli, tsakapfika. Katsa na kingili lye iwanu iwakindile imimaghe ne ipfilungu. Tsawatumighwa na ipfilongotsi we inambiko, iwolangulitsa Ghamalaghitso ne iwabala. <verse number="44" style="v"/>Yuda kaling'a ichitango kingili alyo. “Imunu yanitsomnonela iyo yamumbama. Mumghoghe, mumghale na mumlolese aleke kutsuma.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v"/>Bahala Yuda hayapfikile, kamghendela Yesu kalonga, “Mlangulitsi!” kuya kamnonela. <verse number="46" style="v"/>Apfo, wamkinda, wamghogha Yesu. <verse number="47" style="v"/>Lekeni imunu yumwe mne iwanu iwemile hala, kalapfa limaghe lyake kamtowa imtumwa we Ichilongotsi we Inambiko, kamghana ghutwi lyake.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v"/>Yesu kawalongela, “Pfii mtsa hano ne imimaghe ne ipfilungu kunighogha ka nene nambapfi? <verse number="49" style="v"/>Chila litsuwa tsanahamwe namwe, nolangulitsa mne Ing'anda ye Imulungu, ng'amnighoghile bae. Lekeni leka Ghamaandiko Mahenzeluka ghatimilike.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v"/>Kuya iwanang'ina wose wamleka, watsuma.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v"/>Na imsongolo yumwe iyeghubike ligholole yang'ali yomuwinza Yesu. Hawabamile kumghogha, <verse number="52" style="v"/>kalileka ligholole lyake, katsuma chidako.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kamne libaratsa lye iwabala</para>
  <para style="r">(Matei 26:57-68; Luka 22:54-55,63-71; Yohane 18:13-14,19-24)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v"/>Kuya wamghala Yesu mne ing'anda ye Ichilongotsi we Inambiko, baho ipfilongotsi we inambiko, iwabala ne iwolangulitsa Ghamalaghitso wose wetingana hamwe. <verse number="54" style="v"/>Petiri yang'ali yomuinzilitsa Yesu kwa kutali, kengila mne luwa lya Ichilongotsi we Inambiko, kakala ne iwakalitsi, na yang'ali yakota ghumoto. <verse number="55" style="v"/>Iwakulu we inambiko ne iwanu wose mne libaratsa wabama ukalangama wamwing'e maghomba Yesu ili wadahe kumkoma, lekeni ng'awadahile bae kuupata. <verse number="56" style="v"/>Iwanu wengi walonga ughutsu kuna Yesu, lekeni ukalangama wawo ng'awighalile bae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v"/>Iwanu wamwenga wenuka, walonga ukalangama wa ughutsu, <verse number="58" style="v"/>“Tsatumhulika kolonga, ‘Nitsoihinya Ing'anda ino ye Imulungu iitsengighwe kwa ghamoko na litsuwa lya kadatu nitsotsenga ingi ing'aitsengighwe kwa ghamoko ghe iwanu.’ ” <verse number="59" style="v"/>Hata apfo, ukalangama wawo ng'awighalile bae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="60" style="v"/>Ichilongotsi we Inambiko kenuka hambele he iwanu kamghutsa Yesu, “Pfii kwahela chakwidika mne ukalangama uno iwaulapfile hano?” <verse number="61" style="v"/>Lekeni Yesu kenyamala, ng'alongile bae. Ichilongotsi we Inambiko kamghutsa keli, “Apfi ghweghwe kwa Kiristu, Imwana we Imulungu Yetunyighwe?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="62" style="v"/>Yesu kalonga, “Ona nene. Wose mtsomwona Imwana we Imunu kakala mne ghumoko ghwa kujilo ghwe Imulungu yane Ingupfu, kakutsa mne ghamawingu gha kulanga.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="63" style="v"/>Baho Ichilongotsi we Inambiko kadegha lighwanda lyake, kaghutsa, “Lelo twobama wakalangama wangi wachi? <verse number="64" style="v"/>Ambe mumhulika pfayamlighile Imulungu! Mwemwe mkwonatse?”</para>
  <para style="p">Wose wamhigha yakomighwe. <verse number="65" style="v"/>Iwanu wangi wandusa kumbwalulila Yesu ghamate, wamghubika tsinenge tsake, wamtowa, wamlongela, “Utange, yuhi yakutowile!” Pfipfila iwakalitsi wamsola, wamtowa.</para>
  <para style="s">Petiri kombela Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(Matei 26:69-75; Luka 22:56-62; Yohane 18:15-18,25-27)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="66" style="v"/>Petiri hayang'ali kamne luwa, ipinga yumwe imtumwa we Imtambika mkulu katsa. <verse number="67" style="v"/>Hayamwonile Petiri kakota ghumoto, kamtsodolela tsinenge, kalonga, “Pfipfila naghwe tsa kwahamwe na Yesu Mnatsareti.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="68" style="v"/>Lekeni Petiri kabela, “Simmanyile bae, wala sichimanyile bae chaulonga.” Kuya kalawa kunze mbaka hachikuta, ijogholo keka. <verse number="69" style="v"/>Imtumwa yula hayamwonile keli hala, kawalongela iwanu iwemile hala. Ayuno naye yumwe wawo. <verse number="70" style="v"/>Petiri kabela keli. Hambele chidogho, awala iwemile hala wamghendela. Wamlongela, “Ghweghwe kwa yumwe wawo ghendo, kwaapfila ghweghwe kwa Mgalilaya.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="71" style="v"/>Petiri kandusa kwilighita na kwilaha kuna wawo, “Simmanyile bae imunu yamlonga mbuli tsake.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="72" style="v"/>Bahala ijogholo keka lwakeli, kuya Petiri kakumbuka imbuli ila Yesu iyamlongele, “Ijogholo ng'ana yeke lwa keli, kutsonibela mala ndatu.” Kandusa kulila.</para>
  <chapter number="15" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Yesu koghalighwa kwa Pilato</para>
  <para style="r">(Matei 27:1-2,11-14; Luka 23:1-5; Yohane 18:28-38)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Nemitondotondo, ipfilongotsi we inambiko wetingana hamwe ne iwabala, iwolangulitsa Ghamalaghitso na libaratsa lyose, walamla kumghala Yesu kwa Pilato. Apfo wamwoha, wamghala na wamwing'a Pilato.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v"/>Pilato kamghutsa Yesu, “Apfi ghweghwe kwaimndewa wa Wayahudi?” Yesu kamwidika, “Ona, ka ghweghwe pfaulonga.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v"/>Iwakulu we inambiko wamghutsukila Yesu maghomba mengi. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Apfo, Pilato kamghutsa Yesu keli, “Ng'ukwidika chochose bae? Tegheletsa ghamaghomba ghawo ghose kuna ghweghwe.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v"/>Lekeni Yesu kalema kwidika keli, Pilato kakangawala.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kohighighwa yafe</para>
  <para style="r">(Matei 27:15-26; Luka 23:13-25; Yohane 18:39-19:16)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v"/>Chila Ichihungo che Ipasaka, Pilato tsakatsowela kumlekelela imunu yumwe yohighwe yobamighwa ne iwanu. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Ichipindi acho kukala ne imunu yumwe yakemighwe Baraba, wamwika mne chifungo hamwe ne iwanu iwatendile hengele na iwakomile iwanu mna tsogho kulu. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Na kingili lye iwanu limghendela Pilato na limlomba awatendele ka pfayatendagha. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Naye Pilato kawaghutsa, “Apfi, mwobama nimlekelele Imndewa wa Wayahudi?” <verse number="10" style="v"/>Pilato kamanya ghendo ka pfilongotsi we inambiko wamghala Yesu kuna yeye kwaapfila wamwonela chepfu.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v"/>Lekeni ipfilongotsi we inambiko wawaswangitsa iwanu wamlombe Pilato amlekelele Baraba ihanu ha Yesu. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Pilato kawaghutsa iwanu awo, “Kuya mwobama nimtende choni imunu yamumkema Imndewa wa Wayahudi?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v"/>Iwanu wose wakemelela walonga, “Mkondeke mna msalaba!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v"/>Pilato kawaghutsa, “Apfi atendile choni chihile?”</para>
  <para style="p">Walonga keli kwa kukemelela, “Mkondeke mna msalaba!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v"/>Pilato kabama kuwadeng'eletsa iwanu, apfo kamlekelela Baraba. Kuya kalaghitsa Yesu yafapulighwe ipfiboko, kuya wamkondeke mna msalaba.</para>
  <para style="s">Asikali wombetsa Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(Matei 27:27-31; Yohane 19:2-3)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v"/>Asikali wamghala Yesu mghati mwe ing'anda ye imkulu we isi ya Yudeya, wawakema hamwe wayawo wose. <verse number="17" style="v"/>Wampfatsa Yesu lighwanda lya langi ya tsambarau, wabota litaji lya mihonga, walika mwitwi mwake. <verse number="18" style="v"/>Kuya wandusa kumlamsa, “Mbukwa Imndewa wa Wayahudi!” <verse number="19" style="v"/>Waghendelela kumtowa ne ng'weku mwitwi mwake na kumbwalulila ghamate. Watowa ghamaghoti, wamwinamila. <verse number="20" style="v"/>Kuya hawamalitse kumbetsa, wamtsula lighwanda lya langi ya tsambarau wampfatsa ghamaghwanda ghake. Kuya wamlapfa kunze wamkondeka mne msalaba.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kokondekighwa mne msalaba</para>
  <para style="r">(Matei 27:32-44; Luka 23:26-43; Yohane 19:17-27)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v"/>Hawakalile mnzila, wetingana ne imunu iyakemighwe Simoni, imunu wa Kirene, aba wawo Alekisanda na Lufo. Imunu ayo tsayang'ali yolawa kumghunda koghenda mne ghumji. Asikali wambama aghughale msalaba ghwa Yesu. <verse number="22" style="v"/>Kuya wamghala Yesu hanu hokemighwa Goligota, mana yake, “Hanu ha Pala lya Litwi.” <verse number="23" style="v"/>Wamwing'a idipfai ihanganyighwe na manemane, lekeni Yesu kalema kuinwa. <verse number="24" style="v"/>Kuya wamkondeka mna msalaba, wegholela ghamaghwanda ghake kwa ukwasa hasi tsisimbi walole yuhi yapate lighwanda. <verse number="25" style="v"/>Ikala saa ndatu nemitondo hawamkondeke Yesu mna msalaba. <verse number="26" style="v"/>Wandika lighomba lyake apfino. “IMNDEWA WA WAYAHUDI.” <verse number="27" style="v"/>Kuya wamkondeka Yesu hamwe na wabapfi weli mne misalaba, yumwe kune ghumoko ghwake ghwa kujilo na yungi kune ghumoko ghwake ghwa kumoso. <verse number="28" style="v"/>Apfo ghatimila Ghamaandiko igholonga, “Tsakekighwa hamwe iwanu wehile.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v"/>Iwanu iwang'ali woluta hanu hala wahighitsa ghamatwi ghawo, wamligha Yesu, walonga, “Ambe ghweghwe kudaha kuimwagha Ing'anda ye Imulungu na kuitsenga kwa ghamatsuwa madatu! <verse number="30" style="v"/>Hulumka lelo mna msalaba, wihonetse mwenyegho!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v"/>Pfipfila ipfilongotsi we inambiko na iwolangulitsa Ghamalaghitso wamligha Yesu, walonga, “Kawahonetsa iwanu wengi lekeni ng'odaha bae kwihonetsa imwenyegho! <verse number="32" style="v"/>Leka tumlole ayu Kiristu, Imndewa wa Isiraeli, sambi ahulumke mna msalaba, na twetwe tutsomtoghola!”</para>
  <para style="p">Kuya, iwanu wala weli iwakondekighwe mne misalaba hamwe na Yesu pfipfila wamligha.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kakufa mna msalaba</para>
  <para style="r">(Matei 27:45-56; Luka 23:44-49; Yohane 19:28-30)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v"/>Haipfikile saa sita nemisi, isi yose ighubikighwa ne ichisi ichikalile kwa masaa madatu. <verse number="34" style="v"/>Saa tisa nemisi, Yesu kakemelela, “Eloi, Eloi, lama Sabakitani” mana yake, “Imulungu wangu, Imulungu wangu, mbona kundeka?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v"/>Iwanu wangi iwemile hala hawahulike apfo walonga, “Tegheletsa, komkema Eliya!” <verse number="36" style="v"/>Imunu yumwe katsuma, keka isiki mne lidodoki, kalika mne lubiki, kamwing'a Yesu yainwe. Kuya kalonga, “Tubete tulole ka Eliya kakutsa kumhulumsa mna msalaba.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v"/>Yesu kalila kwa kukemelela, kuya kafa.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v"/>Lipanziya likalile mne Ing'anda ye Imulungu lidegheka mabwende meli kulawa kuchanya mbaka hasi. <verse number="39" style="v"/>Imbala yumwe wa asikali iyemile hambele ha msalaba kona Yesu pfayafile, kalonga, “Imunu yuno tsakakala Imwana we Imulungu ghendo!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v"/>Iwapinga wamwenga tsawalola kwa kutali. Wamwenga wawo tsa Mariya Magidalena, Mariya iyali mai wawo tsina Jakobu mdodo na Yose, na Salome. <verse number="41" style="v"/>Yesu hayang'ali Galilaya, iwapinga awo tsawamuwinza wamtumikila. Iwapinga wamwenga iwalawile naye Yerusalemu pfipfila tsawabahala.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kotsikighwa</para>
  <para style="r">(Matei 27:57-61; Luka 23:50-56; Yohane 19:38-42)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v"/>Ipfika nemihe ya litsuwa lya kwiyandaa, (tsa tsuwa limwe likalile kupfika tsuwa lya sabato). <verse number="43" style="v"/>Yosefu iyolawila mne ghumji ghwa Arimataya, imunu wa libaratsa iyahulikitsighwe ng'ani kapfika. Imunu ayo yang'ali yokalitsa ukutsa kwa undewa we Imulungu. Yosefu kamghendela Pilato bila kumpfuka, kamlomba amwing'e lukuli lwa Yesu. <verse number="44" style="v"/>Pilato tsakakangawala hayahulike ma Yesu kafa. Kamkema imbala wa asikali kamghutsa ka Yesu kafa mwande. <verse number="45" style="v"/>Baho hayahulike apfo kulawa kwe imbalayo, Pilato kamlongela Yosefu alusole lukuli lwa Yesu. <verse number="46" style="v"/>Yosefu kaghula isanda, kahulumsa lukuli lwa Yesu, kalupfatsa isanda na kulwika mne likabuli ilihimbighwe mne libambalawe. Kuya, kabimbilisa libwe kulu hambele ha libani. <verse number="47" style="v"/>Mariya Magidalena na Mariya mai wake Yose wona hanu halwikighwe lukuli lwa Yesu.</para>
  <chapter number="16" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Kutsilihuka kwa Yesu kulawa mne lifwa</para>
  <para style="r">(Matei 28:1-8; Luka 24:1-12; Yohane 20:1-10)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Litsuwa lya Sabato halimalile, Mariya Magidalena, Mariya mai wake Jakobu na Salome waghula ghamafuta, waghenda kulubaka lukuli lwa Yesu. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Nemitondo Jumapili litsua halilawile, waghenda kune likabuli. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Hawang'ali wamnzila weghutsa, “Yuhi yatsolibimbilisa libwe lili mne libani lye likabuli?” <verse number="4" style="v"/>Lekeni hawalolile, walyona libwe lila likulu libimbilisighwa. <verse number="5" style="v"/>Apfo wengila mne likabuli, wamwona imunu yapfalile lighwanda tselu, nawo wakangawala.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v"/>Imunu yula kawalongela, “Mleke kukangawala, mwombama Yesu Mnatsareti yawambighwe. Ng'alibaha bae, katsilihuka! Mlole hanu hawamwikile. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Lelo mghende mkawalongele iwanang'ina wake na Petiri, ‘Yesu kowalongola Galilaya, baho mtsomwona ka pfawalongele.’ ”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v"/>Apfo walawa kunze mwe likabuli, watsuma aku wodedema na kukangawala. Ng'awamlongele imunu wowose bae imbuli ayo kwaapfila tsawapfuka.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu komlawila Mariya Magidalena</para>
  <para style="r">(Matei 28:9-10; Yohane 20:11-18)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v"/>Yesu hayatsilihuke kulawa mne lifwa lupfilipfili mne litsuwa lya Jumapili, kamlawila Mariya Magidalena iyamlapfile ipfinyamkela saba. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Naye kaghenda kuwalongela wayaghe awala iwakalile na Yesu, iwang'ali wakona usungu na kulila. <verse number="11" style="v"/>Hawahulike Yesu katsilihuka na ipinga ayo kamwona, ng'awatoghole bae.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kowalawila iwanang'ina weli</para>
  <para style="r">(Luka 24:13-35)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v"/>Hambele Yesu kawalawila iwanang'ina wake weli aku kana chihanga chingi, hawang'ali woghenda kumghunda. <verse number="13" style="v"/>Nawo woya wawalongela wayawo. Lekeni nawo ng'awatoghole bae.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kowalawila iwanang'ina kumi na yumwe</para>
  <para style="r">(Matei 28:16-20; Luka 24:36-49; Yohane 20:19-23; Ghamatendo 1:6-8)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v"/>Hambele chidogho Yesu kawalawila iwanang'ina kumi na yumwe hawang'ali wakuja. Kawakembela kwaapfila ng'awang'ali wotoghola bae na wasughu kuwatoghola awala iwamwonile kamghima. <verse number="15" style="v"/>Apfo kawalongela, “Mghende mne isi yose muwapetele Imbuli Inoghile wapfilumbe wose. <verse number="16" style="v"/>Imunu wowose iyotoghola na kubatitsighwa, katsokombolighwa, ila imunu wowose iyolema kutoghola katsohighighwa. <verse number="17" style="v"/>Na ipfitango pfino pfoghenda hamwe na awala iwotoghola, Kwa taghwa lyangu watsolapfa ipfinyamkela, na watsolonga kwa lugha ya sambi. <verse number="18" style="v"/>Hata wang'akinda iwanzoka na kunwa sumu ng'awatsolaghighwa bae. Watsowekila ghamoko ghawo iwatamu, nawo watsohona.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v"/>Yesu hayamalitse kulonga ne iwanang'ina wake, kasolighwa kulanga, kakala ghumoko ghwa kujilo ghwe Imulungu. <verse number="20" style="v"/>Kuya iwanang'ina wala waghenda chila hanu kupeta Imbuli Inoghile. Ne Imtwatsa kasang'ana nawo, kalangusa ka kahamwe nawo kwe ipfitango ipfighalile ne Imbuli ayo.</para>
</usx>
